<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Job</book>
  <para style="h">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Job</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="mt">Job</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uz ramah chuan mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Joba a ni; chu mi chu mi famkim, mi ngîl tak, Pathian ṭih mi, thil ṭha lo laka insûm thei mi a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, fapa pasarih leh fanu pathum a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A neihnunzia chu, berâm sângsarih, sanghâwngsei sângthum, bâwngpa tuak zanga, sabengtungpui zanga leh chhiahhlawh tam tak a nei a ni; tichuan, chu mi chu khawchhak fate zîngah chuan mi ropui ber a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a fapate chu an inah an hun zêlah ruai inṭheh chhâwkin an kal khâwm ṭhîn a, an farnu pathumte chu an hnêna ei leh in tûrin an sâwm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chutia an ruaiṭhehte an zawh hnuah chuan Joba chuan anmahni a ko va, a thian hlawm a; zîng takah a tho va, an zaa hming kimin hâlral inthawi a hlân a. Joba chuan, “Ka fapate hian thil an lo tisualin Pathian an lo sawi chhia a ni mahna,” a ti a ni. Joba chuan hetiang hian a ti ziah ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Pathian fapate Lalpa hmaa an inlan ni a lo awm a, Setana pawh an zîngah a lo tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah chuan, “Khawi lam aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a. Tin, Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Leia ka vahvêlna aṭang leh ka chhuk ka chhohna aṭangin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Ka chhiahhlawh Joba hi i ngaihtuah ngai em? Lei chungah hian amah anga famkim, mi ngîl, Pathian ṭih mi, thil ṭha lo laka insûm thei mi tu mah an awm lo asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Joba chuan chhan awm lovin a ṭih em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah chu a in nên, a neih zawng zawng nên, kil tinah i hung vêl a ni lâwm ni? A kut hnathawh mal i sâwm a, he ramah hian a lo neinung sâwt êm êm atin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah hian i kut thawh la, a neih zawng zawng hi han khawihsak teh, i hmaichhan ngeiah a sawi chhe mai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah chuan, “Ngai rawh, a neih zawng zawng chu i kutah a awm e; amah tak erawh chu khawih suh ang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, Setana chu Lalpa hma ata chu a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni khat chu a fanu a fapaten an u ber inah chaw an eia uain an in laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joba hnênah chuan zualko a lo tlân a, “Bâwngpate chuan lei an hrût laia sabengtungte an kianga an tlat laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Seba miten an rawn bei a, an la a, chhiahhlawhte chu khandaihin an that a, keimah chauh hi hrilh tûr chein ka lo chhuak a ni,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêk chuan mi dang a lo tlân leh a, “Vân aṭangin Pathian mei a lo tla a, berâmte leh chhiahhlawhte chu a kâng a, a tiral vek mai a, keimah chauh hi hrilh tûr chein ka lo chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêk chuan mi dang a lo tlân leh a, “Kaldai-ho pâwl thumah an insiam a, sanghâwngseite chu an rawn bei a, an la vek a; a ni, chhiahhlawhte pawh chu an that a, keimah chauh hi hrilh tûr chein ka lo chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêk chuan mi dang a lo tlân leh a, “I fanute leh i fapaten an u ber ina chaw an eia uain an in laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ngai teh, thlalêr aṭangin thlipui a lo thawk a, in chu kil liah a rawn nam a, nula leh tlangvâlhote chu a delh a, an thi ta vek mai a; keimah chauh hi hrilh tûr chein ka chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chu a tho va, a puan a pawt thlêr a, a lû a ziat kawlh a, leiah a tlu a, Pathian a bia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka nu pum ata saruakin ka lo chhuak a, saruak vêkin ka kir leh dâwn a nih hi. Lalpan a pe a, Lalpan a la leh ta a; Lalpa hming chu fakin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawngah hian Joba chu a sual lo va, Pathian chu a mawhchhiat hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian fapate Lalpa hmaa an inlan ni a lo awm leh a, Setana pawh Lalpa hmaa inlan tûrin an zîngah a lo kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Khawi lam aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a. Tin, Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, “Leia ka vah vêlna aṭang leh ka chhuk ka chhohna aṭangin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah chuan, “Ka chhiahhlawh Joba hi i ngaihtuah ngai em? Amah anga mi famkim, mi ngîl, Pathian ṭih mi, thil ṭha lo laka insûm thei mi hi leiah tu mah an awm lo asin. Chhan awm lova mi tihchhiattîr chung pawhin a ngai reng a la ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, “Vun aiah vun tih a ni a. A ni, miin a neih zawng zawng a nunna atân a pe phal ang chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah i kut thawh la, a ruh leh a tisa ngei khawihsak teh, i hmaichhan ngeiah a sawi chhe mai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Ngai rawh, i kutah a awm e, a nunna erawh chu zuah ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Setana chu Lalpa hma ata chu a chhuak a, Joba chu a kephah hnuai aṭangin a lû thlengin pânchhia a veitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A inhiah nân lampei a la a, vut zîngah a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, a nupui chuan a hnênah, “I ngai rengin em ni i awm dâwn? Pathian chu sawi chhia la, thi la a ni mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahse, ani chuan a hnênah, “Nang hi hmeichhe â ṭawngin i ṭawng a nih hi. Eng nge, Pathian hnên ata thil ṭha kan hmu a, thil ṭha lo pawh kan hmu lo vang em ni?” a ti a. Hêng zawng zawngah hian Joba chuan thu sual a sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Joba ṭhian pathumte chuan hêng thil ṭha lo a chunga lo thleng zawng zawng hi an hriat chuan, mahni hmun ṭheuh aṭangin an lo kal a; Elifaza, Temani mi leh Bildada, Suhi mi leh Zofara, Naamathi mite chu. Amah tuarpui tûr leh thlamuan tûra a hnêna lo kal hun an ruat tlâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hla deuh aṭanga an han en chuan an hre lo va, an râwl an chhuah a, an ṭap a; an puante an pawt thlêr a, an lû chungah vaivut an vânvawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, ni sarih leh zan sarih leiah an ṭhutpui a, tu mahin a hnênah thu kam khat mah an sawi lo; a natna chu na êmin an hria a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hetih hnu hian Joba chuan a ka a âng a, a pian ni chu ânchhia a lawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan heti hian a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka pian nî chu boral rawh se, Mipa fa a pai ta e, tihna zân nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu nî chu thim lo ni se; Chung lam aṭangin Pathianin ngaihsak lo se, Eng pawh chu a chungah êng suh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thim leh thihna hlim chuan an ta atân chuh se, Chhûmin bawh reng mai sela; Chhûn tithimtu zawng zawng khân tihlau rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu zân chu zawng thimin chelh reng mai sela, Chu kuma nite zîngah chuan him ve lo sela; Thla chhiarna zîngah pawh lo tel suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu zân chu zân khawhar lo ni se, Tah chuan hlim thâwm lêng suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni ânchhe lawh thiamte chuan ânchhia lawh rawh se, Leviathan chawh thawh thiamte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A vârṭian arsi chu thim sela; Êng lo nghâk se, hmu si lo sela, Zîng khawfîngchat pawh hmu hek suh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu chhûl kawngka a lo khâr loh avâng leh Ka mit hmuha buaina a thup hek loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Engati nge chhûla ka lo thih loh? Engati nge pum ata ka chhuaha ka thaw a lo tâwp loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engah nge mal chunga mi lo chawi? Engah nge ka hnêk tûr hnutêin mi lo hmuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutin ka mu ang a, ka reh riai tawh tûr, Ka muhîl ang a, ka châwl tawh tûr;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lei lalte leh remruatpuitute, Hmun ram lo indinsaktute nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nih loh leh hotute, rangkachak sum neia, Tangkaruaa an in tikhattute nên chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nih loh leh, a hun lova piang thup bo ang ka ni tawh tûr, Nausên êng hmu ngai lote ang mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tah chuan mi suaksualten chawhbuai an bâng a, Tah chuan mi chaute pawh an châwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tah chuan mi tângte an châwl hahdam hlawm a, Vêngtu aw pawh an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tah chuan mi lian mi tê an awm za a, Chhiahhlawh pawh a pu lakah a fihlîm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Êngah nge hrehawm tuar hnênah êng pêk a niha, Engah nge rilrua mangang hnênah nunna pêk a nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thih châk êm êma hmu si lo, Ro phûm zawn aia nasaa zawngtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlân an hmuha lâwma, Nasa taka hlim êm êm tûr hnênah chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi a kawng thup bosaka hnênah engati nge êng pêk a nih, Pathianin huang a hung hnan hnênah chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka ei dâwn pawhin ka thaw a pik a, Ka rûm chu tui angin a luang chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka ṭihzâwng tak ka chungah a lo thleng a, Ka hlauh zâwng tak ka hnênah a lo thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka hahdam lo va, ka awm hle hle thei lo va, Ka châwl thei hek lo; Buaina a lo thleng zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Elifaza, Temani mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I hnênah thu kam khat sawi ila, i hua ang em? Mahse, ṭawng lovin tu nge insûm thei ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai teh, mi tam tak i lo zirtîr a, Kut chak lote i tichak tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I thuin tlute a tungding a, Khûp zâwite chu i tichak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah i chungah a lo thleng ve ta a, i chau va, A han khawih chia, i buai ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I Pathian ṭih hi i rinchhan ber, I kawng ngîlna hi i beisei chhan a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Han ngaihtuah vang vang teh: pawi khawih lo tu nge boral? Khaw nge mi ngîl tihbovin an awm ngai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keia hmuh dân chuan khawlohna lei leta, Buaina tuh chuan a ngai vêk an seng leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian thawah an boral ṭhîn a, A thinrimna chhêmin an ral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sakeibaknei rûm te, sakeibaknei kawlh awrâwl te, Sakeibaknei vânglai ngho te a tliak e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sakeibaknei upa chu ei tûr chhamin a boral a, Sakeibakneipui no hruaite chu an darh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A rûk têin ka hnênah thu a lo thleng a, Ka beng hian a phun ru ser ser chu a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi mut reh lai taka zân inlârna chu ka ngaihtuah laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlauhna ka chungah a lo thleng a, khurhna nên, Ka ruh zawng zawng a tinghîng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hmai hmaah thlarau a kal a, Ka hmulthi a ding sung sung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ding a; mahse, a hmêl lan dân ka thlei thei lo; Rîruang zawng ka hmaah a awm ngei mai; A reh ṭhiap a; tin, aw ka hria a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian hmaah mihring thi thei a fel tâwk em ni? A siamtu hmaah mihring a thianghlim tâwk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai rawh, a chhiahhlawhte pawh a ring zo lo va, A vântirhkohte pawh â a ti a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlum ina chêngte chu a va ring lo zual dâwn êm, Vaivuta siam mai a ni a, Phêngphehlep anga awngrawp maite chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zing leh tlai kârah an boral a, Tukhaw ngaihsak lohvin an ral zêl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An chhûnga puan in thlunna hrui pawh chah a nihin, An thi mai a ni lâwm ni, finna nei lovin?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Han ko teh, chhâng tûr che an awm teh rêng emaw? Mi thianghlim tu lam ber nge i hawi dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vuina hian mi â a tihlum thei a, Itsîknain mi mâwl a that thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi â tak zung kai ka hmu a; Mahse, a chênna chu ânchhia ka lawh nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fate chu an him awzâwng lo, Kulh kawngka bulah chuan chîl thlûkin an awm a, Chhan chhuaktu tûr lah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A buh thar tûr rilṭâmten an ei zo va, Hlîng kâr ata pawh an la a, A neih zawng zawng chu tuihâlten an hap zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuarna hi vaivut ata lo chhuak a ni lo va, Buaina pawh hi lei aṭanga lo ṭo chhuak a ni hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Buai tûrin mihring hi a lo piang a ni zâwk, Mei si chung lamah a chho angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei zawngin Pathian lam ka zawng ang a, Pathian hnênah ka chung thu ka kawltîr ang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil ropui tak zawn chhuah rual lohte, Thil mak tak mai chhiar sên lohte titu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan lei chungah ruah a rawn sûrtîr a, Lo chungah tui a rawn luantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi tlâwmte chu a chawisâng a, Lusûnte chu himnaah a dah chho va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi fingte remruat a phet chhia a, An kutin an tum a puitlin lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi fingte chu anmahni fin vervêknain a âwk a, Mi vervêk remruat chu theh thlâk dêr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhûn êngah thim an tâwk a, Chhûnlaiah zân angin an dap ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An kâa khandaih lak ata retheite a chhan chhuak a, Mi chak kut ata tlachhamte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, retheite chuan beisei an nei a, Khawlohnain a kâ a chîp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai rawh, Pathianin mi a thunun chu a eng a thâwl e; Chuvângin, Engkimtitheia thununna chu ngainêp suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan a tina a, a tuam leh a, A tihliam a, kutin a tidam leh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Buaina parukah a chhan chhuak ang chia, A ni, pasarihah, thil ṭha lo rêng rêngin a khawih lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ṭâm tlâkin thihna ata a tlan ang chia, Indonaah chuan khandaih thiltihtheihna lak ata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭawngkam ṭha lo lakah thup i ni ang a, Chhiatna a lo thlen pawhin i hlau lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chhiatna leh ṭâm chu i nuihsan ang a, Leia sakawlhte i hlau hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rama lungte chu i thurualpui dâwn si a, Rama sakawlhte chuan an rem ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, i puan in chu a râlmuang tih i hria ang a, I huang chu i tlawh ang a, kim lo eng mah a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I thlahte chu tam tak an ni ang a, Rîla rahte chu leia hlobet zât an ni tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kum tling takin i thlân i thleng ang a, A hun têa buhphal têl khâwm tâk ang mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />En teh, kan chhui chhuah tâk hi, heti ngei hi a ni; Ngaithla la, i tâna ṭha tûrin hre rawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, ka manganna hi bûk ni teh sela, Ka vânduaina hi bûknaah dah ni teh sela!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipui ṭiau aiin a rit dâwn si; Chuvâng chuan ka thu a bung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engkimtitheia thal ka chhûngah a awm si a, A tûr chu ka thlarauvin a in zo va; Pathian ṭihbaiawmna chuan mi ep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram sabengtungin hlobet a peh laiin a hrâm em ni? Bâwngpa pawh a buhpâwl chungah a bû em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuina nei lo chu chi tel lovin a ei theih em ni? Artui pâwnvâr pawh hian hânna a nei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nunna hian khawih pawh a duh lo ve, Ka tân ei tûr tenawm tak ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, ka dîl chu hmu thei teh ila! Pathianin ka thil châk chu mi pe teh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathianin mi râwt sawm mai duh teh se! A kut lekin mi tan chhum mai teh sela!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuti pawhin thlamuanna ka la nei cheu, A ni, ka lâwm cheu vang, natna thlah loh chung pawhin, Mi thianghlima thu chu ka phat loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka chakna hi eng nge ni a, ka han nghah rengna tûr chu? Ka tâwpna eng nge ni a, ka han dawh rengna tûr chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka chakna hi lung chakna em ni? Ka tisa pawh hi dâr em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tha han so tûr rêng ka nei lo va, Keimahah sâwm khâwm tûr rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chau ṭêp tawh chungah chuan a ṭhian a ngilnei tûr a ni a, Engkimtitheia ṭihna hawisantu chungah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka unaute chu kawrte rum anga bum hmang an ni a, Kawrte tui relhru ang mai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tui khal avânga lo duma, Vûr inthup ṭhinna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lum hun chuan an kang thîn a, A lo sat chuan an hmun ata an bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sumdâwng rualte chuan an kawng an rawn pênsan a, Ram rovah an lût a, an boral a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tema sumdâwng rualte chuan an en a, Seba khualzinte chuan an beisei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An beisei tak a, an hlawhchham a, An va kal a, an hrilhhai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka chungah chutiang chauh chu in ni, Ka chhiat tawh in hmu a, in hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi pe teh u,” emaw, “In sum in pai mi hlân teh u,” emaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Hmêlma kut ata mi chhan chhuak teh u,” emaw, “Hnehchhiahtute kut ata mi tlan teh u,” emaw ka ti em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi zirtîr ula, ka ngawi ang e; Ka bona lai mi hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu dik chu a chak êm êm! Mahse, in thu hian eng nge a thawh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ṭawng mai mai hi zilh in tum em ni? Mi mangang ṭawng hi thli ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ni, pa nei lo chungah ṭhum in vâwr duh a, Sumdâwn nân in ṭhian in hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tûnah mi en teh mah u, In hmai hmaah ka daw hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Inlamlêt ula, mi dem mai teh suh u, Inlamlêt ula, ka thu hi rêl fel a la ni hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka leiah dik lohna a awm em ni? Thil ṭha lo chu a thlei thei lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leiah hian mihringin tawn tûr a nei reng a ni lâwm ni? A nîte chu inhlawhfa nî ang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh daihlim châk êm êmtu ang leh inhlawhfa a hlawh thlîr rengtu ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eng mah lo maiin thla tam ka lo hmang ral a, Zân ninawm takte ka tân ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mutin, “Eng tikah tak tho vang i maw,” ka ti a; Mahse, zân a rei êm êm; Khawfîngchah thlengin ka let ka let a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tisa chu lung leh bawlhhlawhin a khat a, Ka vun chu a lo phui a, a keh thar leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nîte hi puantahtu khawhthei aiin a liam rang a, Beiseina tel lovin an ral a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nunna hi thli mai a ni tih hre reng la, Ka mitin thil ṭha a hmuh tawh dâwn loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi hmutu mit chuan mi hmu ngai tawh lâwng, I mit ka chungah a fu ang a; mahse, ka awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhûm a kiang a, a boral angin Seol-a chhuk tawh an chhuak leh ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A inah chuan a kîr ngai tawh lo vang a, A hmunin amah a hre leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan ka kam ka sûm lo vang; Thinlung lunghnûrin ka sawi dâwn e; Rilru na ngawih ngawihin ka phunnawi dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuipui nge maw ka nih a, tuipui rûlpui nge maw ka nih a, Nangin mi enthlatu i dah ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka khumin mi tinuam ang a, Ka phunnawi chhan hi ka mut hmunin a tinêp ang, ka ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang lah chuan mumangah mi tihṭhaih a, Inlârnate hmangin mi tihlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nun hian reh hlum a thlang hial ta zâwk a, He ka taksaa chên reng ai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ning hluah hluah, ka nung rei lo vang; Ka awm awmin ka awm ang e, ka nite hi eng mah lo an nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihring hi eng nge maw a niha, i ngaihsâna, A chunga i rilru i nghah tlata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûk tin amah i tlawh ṭhina, Eng lai pawha i fiah ṭhin ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eng chen nge khaw dang hawisan lovin i awm ang a, Ka chil ka lem chhûng tê pawh mi hlamchhiah lova i awm dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sual a nih pawhin i chungah eng nge ka tih ni, Aw, mihringte vêngtu? Engah nge i chhinchhiah atân mi daha, Mahni tâna phurrit ka nih tâk hial hi le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engah nge ka bawhchhiat i ngaihdam lohva, Ka khawlohna i lâk bo loh le? Tûnah vaivutah ka mu dâwn ta si a, Mi zawng chiam ang a; mahse, ka awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Bildada, Suhi mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng chen nge hêng thil hi i sawi dâwn a, I kamchhuak chu thlipui ang a nih reng dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathianin rorêlna a kailek ngai em ni? Engkimtitheian a dik chu a kailek ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I fate a chungah an sual a nih chuan An sual avângin a hrem ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian i zawn ngat ngata, Engkimtitheia hnêna i dîl ngat ngat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thianghlim leh ngîl i nih chuan I tân bengvâr a thawh ngei ang a, Dinhmun dik a pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I bul lamah tê mah la, I tâwp lamah i lian ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmânlai hun kha zâwt chhuak teh aw, An pi pute hmuh chhuah kha ngaihtuah teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimina mi lek kan ni, eng kan hre si lo. Leia kan awm chhûng hi hlimthla chauh a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng chuan an zirtîrin an hrilh chein, An hriatna ṭhate chu an sawi chhuak dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dûm lovah pumphîr a ṭo thei em ni? Tui lovah phairuang a ṭha thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A la duah lai reng pawhin sah thlûk lohvin, Thlai dangte aiin a uai hma ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian theihnghilhtu kawng chu chutiang a ni, Pathian ngaihsak lo mi beiseina chu a bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A innghahna chu a chim darh ang a, A rinchhan chu maimaw rîl mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A in a nghêng a; mahse, a dâwl lo. A vuan tlat a; mahse, a tuar lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni chhuah hma chuan a hring a, A chawrte chuan a huan a hliap a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sih tui sîrah a zung a thlâk a, Lung hmun a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hmun ata tihbo a nihin, Ka hmu ngai lo che, tiin a phat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh, hei hi a kawnga hlimna chu a ni mai, Lei aṭang chuan a dangte an lo ṭo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, Pathianin mi ṭha a paih bo lo vang a, Thil sual titu a tungding hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I kâ nuihnain a tikhat ang a, I hmui pawh hlim au thâwmin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hawtu che chu zahnaa tuam an ni ang a, Mi suaksual puan in pawh a awm tawh lâwng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuti a nih zawng dik takin ka hria; Mahse, engtin nge Pathian hmaah mi a fel theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah hnialkalh duh ang se, Vawi sângah vawi khat pawh a chhâng thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thinlunga fing, chaknaa engkim ti thei, A laka inchhungawng tu nge hmuingîl?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlângte a sawn a, an hre lo va, A thinrima a tihdanglam lai khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei a hmunah a sawi nghîng a, A bante chu a nghîng dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni thu a pe a, a chhuak lo va, Arsite pawh chu a khârkhip a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahni chauhva vân tipharhtu leh tuipui fâwn chunga kal chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zângkhua te, Chhohreivûng te, Siruk te siamtu, Chhim lam pindante siamtu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil ropui chhui chhuah rual loh te, A ni, thilmak tak chhiar sên rual loh titu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka bulah a kal a, ka hmu si lo; A tlang ta zêl a, ka hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai teh, a la mai a, tu nge khap thei? Eng nge i tih, tu nge ti ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin a thinrimna a sûm lo vang a, Rahab puitute a hnuaiah an kûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei tehlulin engtin nge ani chu ka chhân ang a, Amah hnial nân thu eng nge ka thlan chhuah ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dik mah ila, ani zawng ka chhâng lo vang, Ka khinna chu ka dîl zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ko ila, ani chuan mi chhâng sela, Ka thu a dawnsawn ka ring chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlipuiin mi tichhia a, Chhan awm lovin ka hliamte mi belhchhah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thâwk ka lâk pawh mi phalsak lo va, Hrehawmin mi tikhat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chakna thûah chuan, en teh, Chaka chu, Rorêlna lam thûah ani chu tu nge khâwm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dik mah ila, ka kâ hian thiam loh mi chantîr ang. Demawm lo mah ila, mi chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Demawm lo ka ni, ka inngaisâng lo; Ka nun hi ka hmusit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thuhmun vek mai; chuvâng alâwm, Ṭha famkim pawh, suaksual pawh a tichhia, ka tih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chhiatnain thihna a thlen thut chuan, Mi nun tlang tuarna chu a nuihzat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei hi mi suaksual kutah pêk a ni a. A rorêltute hmai a khuha, Amah a nih loh chuan tu dang nge ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hunte hi zualko tlân aiin an chak a, An thlâwk bo va, thil ṭha rêng an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An kal liam a, lawng chak tak angin, Mupui tum nei bir angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka vuina hi ka theihnghilh ang a, Ka lungngai hmêl hi ka dah bo vang a, Ka intihlim ang, ka tihin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka lungngaihna zawng zawng hi ka hlau va, Nangin mi tlangah mi ngai lo vang tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thiam loh chang tûr ka ni a, Eng nge sâwt lo tûra ka ṭan tehchiam ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vûrin inbual mah ila, Ka kutte chingalin sil mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khuarkhurumah mi hnim tho vang a, Ka silhfênte ngei pawhin mi ten ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rorêlna hmaa ding dûna ka chhân tûrin, Ani chu kei anga mihring a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kan chunga kut nghat ve ve tûr, Kan kâra thu titlutu rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka lak ata a tiang la bo sela, A ṭihbaiawmnain mi tihlau suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, amah hlau lovin ka ṭawng ang, Mahni chuan chutiang ka ni si lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thlain a ning e, ka nun hi; Ka nawmmâkin ka phunnawi dâwn e, Rilru na êm êm chungin ka ṭawng dâwn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian hnênah heti hian ka ti dâwn: “Mi thiam lo suh, i mi demna mi entîr zâwk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi hnehchhiaha, i kut hnathawh hmuhsita, Mi suaksual remruat tihên hi ṭha i ti em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tisa mitte chu i nei vein Mihring hmuh angin i hmu em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I nite chu mihring nite ang em ni? I kumte pawh mihring kumte ang em nia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khawlohnate i chhui tehchiama, Ka sualna pawh i zawn tehchiam ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi suaksual ka ni lo tih i hria, I kut ata chhan chhuak tûr lah chu an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I kutin mi din a, mi siam a, kim biaiin; Mahse, nangin mi tiboral a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangin hlum angin mi siam tih hre reng teh aw; Vaivutah mi chantîr leh dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangin hnute tui angin mi leih chhuakin, Hnutekhal angin mi hlâwm a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vun leh tisain mi tuam a, Ruh leh thatein mi phuar khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangin nunna leh duhsakna mi pe a, I mi enkawlna chuan ka thlarau a zuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahse, hêng hi i thinlungan i lo thup a, Nangmahah hei hi a awm tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lo sual ila, nangin mi chhinchhiah ang a, Ka khawlohna ata mi tichhuak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi suaksual lo ni ta ila, ka chung a pik ang; Mi fel ni ila, ka inluling lo vang; Mualpho let dêr chungin leh ka hrehawm enin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo indah sâng ila, nangin sakeibaknei pêlin mi pêl a, Ka chungah mak takin i inentîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka chungah i thu i tharthawh a, Ka chungah i thinur i tipung a, A hlawp hlawpin mi bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eng vânga chhûl ata mi la chhuak nge i nih? Tu ma hmuh hmain lo thi tawh ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Awm lo ang mai ka lo ni ang a, Chhûl ata thlâna lâk ka lo ni mai tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka nite hi rei lo tê a ni lâwm ni? Châwl se, mi ngawihsan se, thâw han la hlek teh ila.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kîr tawh lohna tûr hmuna ka kal hma hian, Thimna leh thihna daihlim ramah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thim chhah mup ram, thim tak mai chu. Thihna daihlim, kawng zâwng awm lo, Êng pawh thim a nihna hmunah chuan.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Zofara, Naamathi mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu heti zozai hi chhân loh theih em ni ang? Mi ṭawng tamin thiam an chang ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I uan thu hian mi a tingawi ang em ni? Tham lo taka i ṭawng hian tu mân an tizak lo vang che maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka rin dân hi a dik a, I mit hmuhah ka thiang a ni,” i ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, aw, Pathian chu han ṭawng teh se, I chungah a kâ han âng teh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A finna thurûk a hriattîr tûr chia, Finna thuah tam tak a ni si a; Chuvângin, hre ta che, i khawlohna aia nêpin, Pathianin i chungah a tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian chu i zawng chhuak zo vem ni? Engkimtitheia chu i hmu kim thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vân aia sâng a ni a, nangin eng nge i tih theih? Seol aia thûk a ni, nangin eng nge i hriat theih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An tehna chu lei aiin a sei zâwk a, Tuifinriat aiin a zau zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kal tlang a, a khâr a, A koh khâwm chuan tu nge dâl thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi lawi lo chu a hre si a, Khawlohna pawh a hmu, zawng lo mah sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram sabengtungno mihringa a pian hunah, Mi lawi lo chuan hriatna a nei chauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang chuan i thinlung i dah dika, A lama kut i phar chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I kuta khawlohna a awm chuan dah bo daih la, I puan inah fel lohna chêng suh sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, hmêlhem lovin i dâk chhuak ngei ang; A ni, i nghet ang a, i hlau lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hrehawm i theihnghilh ang a, Tui luang bo tawh angin i hre reng lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I nun chu chhûn pachang aiin a êng ang, Thim pawh awm se, zîng ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, muanawm takin i awm ang, beisei a awm vângin; A ni, i en vêl ang a, muang takin i châwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I mu ang a, tu mân an tihlau lâwng che, A ni, tam takin an be tlawn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, mi suaksual mit chu a thlâwn ang a, Tlân chhuahna kawng rêng an nei lo vang. An nghahfâk ber pawh thih mai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni ngei mai, mi fing zawng in lo nih hi, In rualin finna a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahse, nangni angin hriatna ka nei ve bawk, In lakah ka neu bîk lo ve, A ni, tu nge thil hetiang hi hre lo awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ṭhiante nuihzatbûr ka ni, Kei, Pathian kova, a chhâna ngei hi Mi fel, mi famkim si, nuihzatbûr ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi nuamsa rilruah chuan vânduai hmuhsitna a awm; Rahbi tleute a châng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suamhmang puan in a hmuingîl a, Pathian tithinurtute an him a, An kuta an pathian rawn kengtute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rante pawh zâwt teh khai, an zirtîr ang che, Chunglêng savate pawh zâwt la, an hrilh ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei pawh bia la, a zirtîr ang che, Luipui sanghate chuan i hnênah an puang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng thil zawng zawngah hian tu nge hre lo awm, Lalpa kut chuan hei hi a ti a ni tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kutah thil nung tin nunna leh mihring chi zawng zawng thlarau a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bengin thu a chian lo vem ni, Kâin ei tûr a tem ang hian?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Upa hnênah finna a awm a, Khuareiah hriat thiamna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hnênah finna leh chakna a awm a, Remhriatna leh hriat thiamna a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai rawh, a ṭhiat a, sak leh rual a ni lo, Mi a khâr hnan a, hawn rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai rawh, tuite chu a chelh a, an lo kang a, A rawn tîr chhuak leh a, leilung an tuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hnênah chakna leh finna a awm a, Bum leh bumtu a ta an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Remruattute ruakin a hruai bo va, Rorêltute a tiâ a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalte phuarna chu a phelh a, An kâwng chu kâwnghrênin a hrêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiamte ruakin a hruai bo va, Mi chakte a titlu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mî rinte thusawi a sawn a, Upate hriatna a la bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi liante chungah hmuhsitna a leih bua a, Mi chakte taihrên a phelhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thim ata thil thûkte a dap chhuak a, Thihna hlim chu êngah a la chhuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hnamte chu a tipung a, a tiral a, Hnamte chu a tilian a, a hruai bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei mipui hotute thinlung a la bo va, Thlalêr kawng awm lohnaah a vahvaihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Êng awm lovin thimah an dap a, Zu rui angin a paitîr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En ta che u, hêng zawng zawng hi ka mitin a hmu a, Ka bengin a hria a, a hre thiam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In hriat chu ka hre ve bawk e, In lakah ka neu bîk lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahse, Engkimtitheia hnênah chuan sawi ngei ka duh a, Pathian nêna ngaihtuah dun ka châk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni, dâwt phuahchawptu in ni a, In zain dâktawr hlu lo in ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngawi hmiah mai teh ula aw! Fin in hlawh zâwk tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngaihtuah dân ngaithla ula, Ka dîlna kamchhuak bengkhawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian tân khawlo takin in ṭawng ang maw? A tân dâwtin in ṭawng ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah ṭanin hleih in nei ang maw? Pathian tân in pâwng ṭan dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zawng chhuak che u sela, a ṭha dâwn em ni? Miin mihring a bum angin amah in bum dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A rûka hleih in neih chuan a zilhhau ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ropuina chuan a tihlau lo vang che u maw? A ṭihbaiawmna chu in chungah a tla lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In upa thute chu thufing vaivut mai a ni a, In invênnate chu invênna hlum mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ṭawng theih nân lo ngawi teh u, Ka chungah eng pawh lo thleng ang hmiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tisa hi ka hâin ka pet ang a, Ka nun hi ka kutah ka dah em ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tihlum hial mah sela, amah chu ka nghâk cheu vang; Mahse, a hmaah ka kawng chu ka ṭan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hei hi ka chhandamna a ni a, A hmaah Pathian hre lo mi an lo kal dâwn loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka sawi hi ngun takin ngai ula, Ka puan chhuah hi in bengah lût rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ka thu ka rem fel tawh a, Thiam ka chang ang tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu nge mi hnialtu tûr awm? Tichuan, ka ngawi ang a, thlarau ka thlah mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka chungah thil pahnih hi ti lo phawt la; Tichuan, i hmêl lakah ka inthup lo vang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka hnên ata i kut la kîr daih la, I ṭihbaiawmna hian mi tihlau suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, mi ko la, ka chhâng ang che, A nih loh leh, kei ṭawng ila, mi chhâng thung ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka khawlohna leh sualnate engtia tam nge ni? Ka bawhchhiatna leh ka sualna mi hriattîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Engah nge i hmêl i thupa, I hmêlmaa mi ngaih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hnahthel lêng chu i chhaih buai dâwn em ni? Buhpâwl ro chu i ûm dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka chungah na takin i ziak a, Ka tleirâwl lai khawlohnate mi phurhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka keah kawl mi buntîr a, Ka kawng zawng zawng i chhinchhiah a, Ka kephah hualin ramri i kham a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thil mawih ṭawih ral mai ang leh, Silhfên thîm ei ang lek ka ni chung hian.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmeichhe hrin mihring tawh phawt chu rei lo tê dam, buainaa khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pangpâr angin a lo chhuak a, a vuai leh a, Hlimthla angin a thlâwk bo va, a awm hlen lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutiang mi chungah chuan i mit i mengin, Rorêlnaah i hnênah mi hruai em ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu nge thianghlim lo ata thianghlim la chhuak thei le? Tu mahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nite chu ruat sa a niha, a thla zât lah chu i hnêna a awma, A pelh theih loh tûra ramri chu i ruat ahnuin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hawi bosan langin, a chawlh theih nân, Hlawhfa anga a nî a tlingtlâk thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thing chu râwt pawh ni se, a chawr leh ang, A chawrno a tâwp lo vang tih beiseina a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leia a zung lo tar mah se, A bul chu lei chinah thi mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui rimah a chawr ṭiam ṭiam ang a, Thil phun angin a lo buk chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahse, mihring chu a thi a, a rîral a, A ni, mihring chuan a thlarau a thlah a, khaw nge a awm tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipui ata tui a kal bo va, Luipui a kang a, a ro châr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiangin mi an mu a, an tho leh lo. Vân awm loh hma loh chuan an ṭhangharh lo vang, An muhîl kaihthawh an ni hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Seol-ah chuan mi thukru teh la, I thinur reh hma chu mi thukru teh la, Hun bîk mi ruatsakin mi hre reng teh la aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi a thih chuan a nung leh ang em ni? Ka hun ruat chhûng hi chuan ka nghâk ang, Ka chhuahna a thlen thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi ko vang a, keiin ka chhâng ang che; I kut hnathawh i ngaina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mahse, nangin ka pênte i chhiar a, Ka sual i enthla lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ipah ka bawhchhiatna chilh a ni a, Ka khawlohna i ṭhui khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlâng chim meuh pawh chu a rîral a, Lungpui pawh a hmun ata sawn a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui chuan lungte a hrût hêk a, Tui lian chuan lei vaivut a lên bo va; Chutiangin mihring beisei chu i tibo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chu i hneh kumkhua a, a ral ta a, A hmêl i tidanglam a, i tîr bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fapaten an rawn chawimawi a, a hre lo va; Tihtlâwmin an awm a, a hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A taksa nâ chu a hre chauh va, A thlarauvin amah a sûn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Elifaza, Temani mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi fingin hriatna lothlâwn hmangin a chhângin, Khawchhak thliin a pum a tipuar ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭawng tlâktlâi lo hmangin emaw, Thusawi ṭhatna nei lo hmangin emaw a sawi dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ni, ṭihna chu i tibo va, Pathian hmaa inhlanna i tineu va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I khawlohna chuan i kâ a thunun a, Fin vervêk ṭawng i thlang a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei ni lovin, nangma ṭawngkam ngeiin a thiam lo che a, A ni, i hmui ngeiin a hêk che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Piang hmasa ber i ni em ni? A nih loh leh, tlângte awm hmain i piang tawh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian thurûk chu i hria em ni? Nangma tân chauh finna i khûrkhung em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan hriat loh eng nge i hriat bîk? Kan hriat thiam loh eng nge i hriat thiam bik?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan hnênah hian lûa kêlsam ṭo tawhte leh upa takte, I pa aia upa daihte an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I tân Pathian ṭawng thlamuanna hi a neu lutuk em ni? Nêm taka a tihna thu che hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engah nge i thinlungin a hruai bo che? Engtizia nge i men tâl tawp tawp ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian chungah thaw i sang a, I kâa chutiang thu a chhuah kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thianghlim tûr chuan mihring hi eng nge a nih? Fel tûr chuan hmeichhe hrin hi eng nge a nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, a mi thianghlimte chungah rinna a nghat lo va, A ni, a mit hmuhah chuan vân pawh a fai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi tenawm leh bawlhhlawh sa, Khawlohna, tui ina in chu a va ni lo lehzual dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi ngaithla la, ka entîr ang che, Ka hmuh chu ka puang dâwn e
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Mi fingten an hril ṭhina chu, An pi puten an thup loh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anmahni chauh ram an lo pêk, Mi dang tu mah tel lohna chu):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan a dam chhûng zawng nâ a tuar a, Hnehchhiahtu tâna kum tuk zâtte pawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlauhawm thâwmte chu a bengin a hria a, A hmuingîl laiin rawktuin a rawn bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thim ata chhuah a inring lo va, A hmabâk chu khandaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ei tûr zawngin a vâkvai a, “Khaw nge?” tiin, Thimna ni chu a kutah ngâ sa a ni tih a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hrehawmna leh thawpikna chuan a tihlau va; Lal inpeih sain indona a hneh angin amah an hneh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian chunga a kut a lek leh Engkimtitheia chunga chapo taka a chêt avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Luhlul takin ama chungah a tlân a, A phaw lai pâwng chhah pui nên chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A thauvin a hmai a tuam a, A kâwngah thau a chheng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khawpui ṭiau hnuahte a chêng a, Tu ma luah loh inahte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A hausa lo vang a, a sum leh pai chu a awm hlen hek lo vang a, An neihte chu lei lamah an kûr hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thim ata a chhuak lo vang a, Meialhin a zârte a hliau ro vang a, A kâa a thawah a kal bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mahni inbumin eng mah lovah innghat suh se, A hmuh tûr chu eng mah lo a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A hun hmain a tlingtla ang a, A zâr chu a hring lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Grêp hrui angin a rah hel a sawi ṭîl ang a, Olive thing angin a pâr a thing thla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak lo pâwlte chu an cha dêr ang a, Thamna puan inte chu meiin a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pawi khawih an ngaihtuah a, Khawlohna an rawn chhuah a, An pumin bumna a buatsaih a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutiang thil chu tam tak ka hria a ni, In zain thlamuantu tuar hrehawm in ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thu ruakin tâwp a nei ang em? A nih leh, engin nge chawk tho chia i han chhân ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei pawh in ṭawng angin ka ṭawng thei a ni; Ka nih ang hi ni ula chuan, In chungah thu ka zawm khâwm chiam thei ang a, Lu ka thin khum thei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, ka kâ chuan ka tichak ang che u a, Ka hmuia thlamuanna thuin a tinuam ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawi mah ila, ka lungngaihna a dai lo va, Ngawi mah ila, eng nge ka nawm chuanna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, Aman mi tichau va, Ka pâwlpuite zawng zawng chu i tiṭiau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangin mi chelh bet a, chu chu ka chunga hretu a ni a, Ka chêrna hian mi hêk a. Chu chu ka hmaichhana hriattîrtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thinurin mi tai thlêr a, mi tiduhdah a, Ka chungah a ha a ṭhial a, Ka khingpuiin ka chungah a mit a lên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka chungah an kâ an âng a, Dichim takin biangah mi bêng a, Ka chungah an inhâwr khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak lo kutah mi hlân a, Mi suaksualte kutah chuan mi theh lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nuamsa takin ka awm a, aman mi phel darh a, A ni, ka ringah mi la a, mi pawt sawm a; A tin tûr atân mi târ bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thal kâptute chuan mi hual vêl a, Ka kalte chu a ṭhen darh a, a dîm lo, Lei chungah ka mît a leih bua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhiatna chunga chhiatnain mi tichhia a, Mi hrâng angin ka chungah a lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka vun chungah saiip puan ka bel a, Ka ki chu vaivutah ka tâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭah vângin ka hmêl a sen a, Ka mit vunah thihna hlim a awm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka kutah pâwngnêkna a awm lo va, Ka ṭawngṭaina a thianghlim chung pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw leilung, ka thisen chu khuh bo suh la, Ka ṭah hian chawlh hmun nei suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tûnah pawh, ngai rawh, ka thuhretu vânah a awm a ni e, Mi hriatpuitu chu vân sângah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ṭhiante chuan mi nuihsan a; Mahse, Pathian hnênah ka mittui a sûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian hnênah miin mihring hi ṭan teh sela aw, Mihring fapain a ṭhenawm a ṭan ang hian!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kum rei lo tê a lo ral hunah Ka kîr leh lohna tûr kawng chu ka zawh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thlarau a rawih ta, ka nîte a ral ta, Ka chanpual chu thlân a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nuihsantute ka hnênah an awm zawng a nih hi, An thu thin tiurah chuan ka mit a fu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I hnênah ka tân thutiam siam teh, Tu nge ka tân zakhamna ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hriat thiamna lakah an thinlung i thup a; Chuvângin, anni zawng i chawisâng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hlâwkna atâna a ṭhian thlauthlatua chu, A fate mit pawh a chuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mite zînga kamram mai atân mi siam a, Tenawm langsâr tak ka lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungngaih vângin ka mit pawh a thim a, Ka bung zawng zawng hi hlimthla ang a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ngîl takte chuan hei hi mak an ti ang, Mi pawi khawih lo chu pathian nei lote chungah a thinur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi fel chuan a kawng ngai a chelh tlat a, Kut fai nei chu a chak deuh deuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In zain lo kîr ula, lo kal teh u, In zîngah mi fing ka hmu chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nîte a liam ta, ka thil tumate a thlâwn zo ta, Ka thinlung ngaihtuah ṭhinte ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zân chu chhûnah a chantîr a; Êng chuan thim a hnaih e, an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Seol chu ka in anga ka ena, Thim hnuaiah ka khum ka dawha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhiatna hnênah, “Ka pa i ni,” ka tiha, Changpât hnênah, “Ka nu leh ka farnu in ni,” ka tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka beisei chu khawiah nge? Ka beisei chu tu nge hmu ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Seol kawngkaah a chhuk ang a, Vaivutah kan chhuk dûn ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Bildada, Suhi mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng chen nge thu remchâng in dap dâwn? Ngaihtuah ula, chumi hnuah kan sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eng tizia nge ran anga ngaih kan niha, I mit hmuha tenawm kan nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang, mahni thinurnaa intai thlêrtu, Nangmah avângin lei kalsan a ni dâwn em ni? Lungpui pawh a hmun ata sawn a ni dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni, mi suaksual êng chu tihmih a ni ang a, A mei sî pawh a de lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A puan ina êng chu a thim ang a, A kianga khâwnvâr chu tihmih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ke pên chakna chu a chêp ang a, Ama remruat ngeiin a paih thla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ke ngeiin lênah a paih lût a, Hum chungah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kerêkah thangin a hlîng ang a, Ani chu thangin a man ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tân leiah valh phûm a ni a, Kawngah a tân thang kam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kil tinah hlauhawmin a tihlau vang a, A hnungah chuan a ûm zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A chakna a ṭâmchhâwl ang a, A kiangah chhiatna a inpeih reng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A taksa bung hrangte a ei zo vang a, Thihna fa tîrin a bung hrangte a ei zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A rin pui puan in ata chu kar phawh a ni ang a, Hlauhawmho lal hnênah hruai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mi ni ngai lo a puan inah an chêng ang a, A chênnaah kât theh darh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhûngrilah a zung a mawih ang a, Chung lamah a zâr a vuai bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei ata a hriat rengna a boral ang a, Kawtthlêrah hming a nei tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Êng ata thimah len luh a ni ang a, Khawvêl ata ûm chhuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mite zîngah tu leh fa a nei lo vang a, A chênnaah châmbâng tûr a nei hek lâwng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thlang lama miten ani hi mak an ti ang a, Chhak lama mite an thlabâr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi fel lo chênna zawng chutiang chu a ni ngei a, Chu chu Pathian hre lotu hmun a ni e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng chen nge mi tihhrehawm ang a, Thutea mi vuak vual dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vawi sâwm lai mi dem chhe ta a. Ṭha lo taka ka chunga tih hi in zak hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dik lo pawh lo ni ta ila, Ka dik lohna chu keimahah ka pai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka chunga intilian in niha, Ka chhiatna hi mi hnialfunga hmang in nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hre ta che u, Pathianin mi paih thla a, A lênin mi tuam a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh u, “Pâwngnêkna!” tiin ka au chhuak a; Mahse, chhân ka ni lo va; Ṭanpui dîlin ka au va; mahse, rêl dikna a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kawng dai a theu hnan a, ka pêl thei lo, Ka kawngte chu thimin a khuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ropuina mi hlihsak a, Ka lûa lallukhum chu a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kawng tinah mi tichhia a, ka ral a ni ta; Ka beiseina chu thing angin a pawt phawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thinurna ka chungah a mût kai a, A hmêlma angah mi chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sipai rual an kal khâwm a, Ka lamah kawng an thlâk a, Ka puan in vêlah bûk an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka unaute ka lakah a tihla a, Ka hmêlhriatte ka lakah an mi hrang zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka laichînten mi chu-kha ta lo va, Ka ṭhian bulten mi theihnghilh zo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ina chêngte leh ka in awm nulaten mikhualah mi chhiar a, An mit hmuhah hmel hriat loh ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh ka ko va, mi chhâng lo va. Kam thlumin ka ngên tûr a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka nupui tân ka rim a chhia a, Ka chhûl khat kualpui tân ka tenawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangte lamin mi hmusit a, Ka han tho hi mi êu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ṭhian ṭha zawng zawngten mi ten a, Ka hmangaih ṭhinte chu ka lakah an ner ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka vun leh ka tisa hi ka ruhah a bet a, Ka hahni chu ka la chang hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw, nangni ka ṭhiante u, Mi khawngaih rawh u, mi khawngaih rawh u, Pathian kutin mi khawih a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Engah nge Pathian ang ziazânga mi tihduhdaha, Ka tisa tuarna hi tâwk in la tih loh ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw, ka thute chu ziak ni teh sela! Lehkhabuahte chuang teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziakna thîr leh suanin, Lungpuiah kumkhua atân ziak ni teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka Tlantu chu a nung tih ka hre si a, Nakinah chuan leiah hian a lo la ding ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka vun hi tihchhiata a awm hnuin, Ka tisain Pathian ka la hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima tân ngei ka la hmu ang a, Ka mitin a la thlîr ang, mi dang ni lovin. Ka chhûngah ka rilru a chau ta!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Engtin nge amah chu kan tihduhdah ang, Thil bulte amahah hmu siin?” in tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khandaih chu hlau rawh u, Thinurna chuan khandaih hremna a thlen si a, Rorêlna a awm tih in hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Zofara, Naamathi mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hei vâng hian ka ngaihtuahnate chuan chhânna mi siam a, Ka chhûnga hmanhmawhna a awm avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zilhna mi tizaktu chu ka hre ta a, Ka hriat thiamna rilru chuan mi chhâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmasâng ata leia mihring awm achin, Hei hi i hre lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi suaksual hlimna chu a tawi a, Pathian hre lo mi lâwmna chu mit khap kâr chauh a ni, tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ropuina chuan vânte thleng chhovin, A lû chuan chhûmte tawng mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama zun êk angin a boral vang vang ang; Amah hmu tawhte chuan, “Khawiah nge a awm tâk?” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mumang ang maiin a thlâwk bo vang a, Hmuh a ni lo vang; A ni, zân inlârna anga ûm bo a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah hmu ṭhîn mit khân a hmu tawh ngai lo vang a, A hmun pawhin a hmu ngai tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A faten mi retheite khawngaihna an dîl ang a, A kutin a sum leh pai chu a theh kîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ruhte chu a tleirâwl sualnain a khat a; Mahse, vaivutah a mutpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suahsualna hi a kâah thlum mah se, a lei hnuaiah thukru mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zuat hliauvin thlah phal lo mah se, A kam chhûngah hmuam reng zâwk mah sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pum chhûngah a lo danglam a, A chhûngah rûl tûr kha tak a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hausaknate chu a lem a, a law chhuak leh a, Pathianin a pum ata a paih chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rûl tûr chu a fâwp ang a, Rûlrial tûr chuan amah a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Luipuite chu a thlîr lo vang a, Khawizû leh bâwnghnute khala luang luite chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thawh chhuah chu a theh kîr ang a, hrawk tlai nân a hmang lo vang; A lâk khâwmte chu a chên lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Retheite chu a hnehchhiahin a hawisan a, In, a sak loh chu, a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A duhâmna chu a kawchhûngah a awm hle hle thei lo va, A lâwmna thilte chu eng mah a hum lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ei zawh loh eng mah a awm lo va; Chuvângin, a sum leh pai chuan a tuar lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hausak vânglai tak chu a chêp hun a ni ang a, Tlachhamte chuan a chungah kut an lên huai huai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pum tipuar tûrin a thinur hlauhawm tak chu a chungah a tîr ang a, A ei atân a chungah a sûrtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thîr hriamhrei chu a tlân bosan ang a, Dâr thal ngul chuan amah a kâp tlang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A han pawt phawi a, a taksa ata a lo chhuak a, A ni, a hmâwr tle tak chu a mit ata a lo chhuak a, Thil râpthlâk a chungah a thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ro atân thim chhah mup khâwl khâwm a ni a, Chhêm loh mei chuan a kâng ral ang a, A puan in ata hnutchhiah awm apiang a tiral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vânte chuan a khawlohna an puang ang a, Leiin amah a do vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A ina thil pungte chu an bo vang a, A thinur nîah chuan a bungruate an luang ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hei hi Pathian laka mi suaksual chanpual a ni a, Ro luah tûr Pathianin a tân a ruat chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thusawi hi ngun takin ngaithla teh u, Hei hi in thlamuanna thu chu ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi ngaichâng ula, ka han sawi phawt ang a, Ka sawi zawhah la nuihsan ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keia phunnawina hi mihring chungah em ni? Dawhthei rual ka ni em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi en ula, mak ti ula, kutin in kâ hup rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka han ngaihtuahin ka mang a ang a, Hlauhnain ka thauvah mi a man ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engtizia nge mi suaksualte chu an nuna, An lo upata, a ni, an lo hmuingîl theih ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An chi thlahte chu an hnênah an mit hmuhah a tinghet a, An rîla rahte chu an hmai hmaah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An in lote chu hlauhawm lakah a him a, Pathian tiang chu an chungah a tla hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An bâwngpain chi a thlah a, a pelh ngai lo va, An bâwngpuiin no a nei a, a chhiat ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ran rual angin an fanaute an chhuahtîr a, An fate chu an tualchai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An perhkhuang leh ṭingṭang remin an zai a, An phênglâwng thâwmah an hlim za a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An nite chu neinung takin an khawh ral a, Seol-ah chuan thlamuang takin an liam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pathian hnênah, “Min kalsan rawh, i kawngte hriat hi kan châk lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engkimtitheia chu tu nge a nih, a rawng kan bâwlna tûr chu? A hnênah kan ṭawngṭaiin hlâwkna eng nge kan hmuh ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A! An sum leh pai chu an kuta awm a lo ni lo, Mi suaksualte remruatna chu ka lakah a hla a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi suaksual meichher chu vawi eng zât meuh nge a miha, Vânduaina an chunga a thlena, A thinurnain Pathianin lungngaihna a pêk hlawm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vawi eng zât nge buhpâwl, thliin a chhêm ang an niha, Favai, thlipui len bo ang an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pathianin khawlohna an fate tân a dah,” in ti a, Anmahni chungah thlentîr ang hmiang, an hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anmahni mit ngeiin an chhiatna chu hmu se, Engkimtitheia thinurna chu in ang hmiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A bo hnuah a in chu a tân eng nge a nih, A thla zât tihtâwp a nih hun chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian tu nge hriatna zirtîr ang, Mi chungnungte pawh rorêlsaktu chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A vânglai takin mi a thi a, Muang tak leh nuam taka awmin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A taksa chu thauvin a khat a, A ruh thlîng pawh a hnâwng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, mi dang lungngai takin a thi a, Ṭhatna rêng rêng tem ngai lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vaivutah angkhatin an mu a, Changpâtin a bâwm khat hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai teh, in ngaihtuahte zawng ka hria alâwm, Dik lo taka ka chunga in phiarte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Khaw nge hotu in chu a awm? Mi suaksual chên kualna puan in chu khaw nge?” in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zin vêl mite in zâwt ngai lo vem ni? An sawite chu in pawm lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi sual chu vânduai nîah zuahin a awm a, Thinur nîah hruai chhuah an ni, tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu nge a hmai hmaah a kawng chu puang ang a, Tu nge a thiltih chu thungrûl ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thlânah kalpui a ni a, A thlân chu vên a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lei tlang pawhin a delh na lo. Mi zawng zawngin a hnu an chhui a, A hmaa chhiar sên loh lo awm tawhte ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, engtin nge thu eng mah lo takmeuhva mi thlamuan dâwn? In chhânnaah hian dâwt mai lo chu eng mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Elifaza, Temani mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihring hian Pathian tân ṭangkaina a nei em ni? Miin a fin chu a ṭangkaipui ngei tak e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi fel i nih chu Engkimtitheia tân a hlû em ni? I kawngte i tihfamkim chu a tân a hlâwk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah i ṭih nân em ni a zilh che a, Rorêlnaa a luhpui che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I suahsualna a nasa a ni lo maw? I khawlohnain tâwp rêng a nei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng mah lovan i unau hnên ata dahkham i phût a, Saruakte chu an silhfên i hlihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chaute hnênah tui in tûr i pe lo va, Rilṭâmte tân chaw i ui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tharum thawhin mi ram i la lui a, I duhsak zâwngte i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeithaite chu ruakin i tîr bo va, Pa nei lote bân chu i titliak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan i vêlin thang a awm a, Hlauhna chuan a tibuai ta thut che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I hmuh theih loh thimna leh Tui tam tak chuan a khuh che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vân sângah Pathian a awm lo vem ni? Arsi sâng berte en la, an sânzia mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin eng nge a hriat? Thim chhah danah a rêl thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmuh loh nân chhûm chhah takin a khuh a, Vân kual chungah chuan a kal vêl a, i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kawng hlui chu i zawh dâwn em ni? Mi suaksualten an zawh ṭhina kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anni chu an hun hmaa lâk bovin an awm a, An innghahna chu lui len bovin a awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian hnêna, “Min kiansan rawh, Engkimtitheia chuan eng nge min tih theih?” titute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuti chungin an inte thil ṭhain a tikhat, Mi suaksualte remruat chu ka lakah a hla a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi felte chuan an hmu a, an lâwm a, Mi pawi khawih lote chuan anmahni an nuihsan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Kan chunga lo dingte tihbovin an awm a, a bâng meiin a kâng ral a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmah ngeiin amah tlawn la, remna siam rawh; Tichuan, i tân thil ṭha a lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kâa chhuak dân chu dawng ngei teh aw, I thinlungah a thu dah ṭha ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkimtitheia hnêna i kîr chuan tundin i ni ang a, I puan in ata fel lohna i dah bo daih phawt chuanin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I rote chu vaivutah dah la, Ophir rangkachakte chu luite lung zîngah dah rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Engkimtitheia chu i ro a ni ang a, Tangkarua hlu takte chu i ta a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Engkimtitheiaah chuan i lâwm tawh ang a, Pathian lam chu i hawi tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A hnênah i ṭawngṭai ang a, a ngaithla ang che; Tin, i thutiamte chu i hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thil i ruat ang a, i tân a ding nghet ang a; Tin, i kawngte chu êngin a chhun fo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An paih thlâk che pawhin, “Din chhuahna a awm,” i ti ang a, Mi inngaitlâwm chu a chhandam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawi khawih lo ni lo pawh a chhan chhuak ang a, A ni, i kut thianghlimna azârah chhan chhuahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vawiin pawh ka vuina hi a nasa e, Ka rûm chung pawhin kut chu a rit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, amah ka hmuh theihna tûr lam chu hria ila, A ṭhut hmunah chuan ka kal tûr a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thu chu a hmaah ka thlen ang a, Ka kâ ṭanfungin a khat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mi chhânna tûr thute ka hre duh a, Ka hnêna a sawi tûr chu hriat thiam ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thiltihtheihna ropui chuan mi khing dâwn em ni? Hnai lo ve, mi bengkhawn zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, mi fel chuan a hnênah a ngên ang a, Mi ngaihtuahtu hnên ata chu ka chhuak vang vang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai teh, hma lam ka han pan a, amah a awm si lo, Hnung lam ka han pan a, amah ka hmu thei chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vei lama a thawh lai pawhin ka hmu thei chuang lo va, Ding lamah a nih leh, a biru a, ka hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kawng zawh chu a hria a, Mi fiah hunah rangkachak angin ka chhuak dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ke hian a hniakhnung tak a dai zêl a, A kawng ka zawh a, ka pêng lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kamchhuak thupêk chu ka pênsan lo va, A kâa thute chu ka dân aiin ka roh zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi nghet a ni a, tu nge khawih her thei ang? A duh zâwng chu a ti mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka chana ruat chu a ti a, A rilruah chutiang chu a awm ṭeuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a hmaah ka buai a, Ka ngaihtuahin amah ka hlau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathianin ka thinlung chu a tichau va, Engkimtitheia chuan mi tibuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thimna chuan mi hual vêl a, Thim chhah pui chuan ka hmai a khuh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Engkimtitheian engah nge hun a ruat loh? Amah hretuten engah nge a nîte an hmuh loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ri sawn chîngte an awm a, Ran rual an man lui a, an vulh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa nei lote sabengtung an ûm bosak a, Hmeithai bâwngpa, dahkham atân an lâksak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlachhamte kawng an botîr a, Leia retheite an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, thlalêra ram sabengtungte angin, taima taka ei tûr zawngin an hna an va thawk a, An fate tân thlalêrin chaw a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An chaw tûr ram ata an ât a, Mi sual grêp huan hmaih ṭhelh an vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Silhfên lovin zankhuain an mu a, Khaw vâwtah inkhuhna an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlânga ruahpuiin a nan huh a, Phen tûr nei lovin lungpui an bêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pa nei lo hnute hne lai pawh thlâksak chîngte an awm a, Retheite hnên ata dahkhamah an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Silhfên lovin saruakin an vâkvai a, Rilṭâm chungin buhphalte an pu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hriak an siam a, chûng mite hung chhûngah chuan, Uain sâwrna an chîl a, tuihâl chungin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawpui bit takah mite an rûm a, Mi hliam rilru chu a au chhuak a; Pathian lahin thil dik lo chu a bengkhawn hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Êng laka helte an awm a, A kawngte lah an hre lo va, A kawng takah pawh an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vârṭianah tualthattu chu a tho va, Rethei leh tlachhamte a that a, Zânah chuan rûkru ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Uirepa mitin thimhmul a thlîr a, “Tu mân mi hmu lo vang,” tiin. Hmai khuhnain a hmai a tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thimah inte an lai pawp a, Chhûnah an inkhâr khung a, Êng rêng an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An za atân zîng chu thihna daihlim ang a ni a, Thihna daihlim ṭihbaiawm chu an nêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tui chungah chuan chak taka len an ni a, Leiah hian an chanvo chu ânchhe dawng a ni. Grêp huan kawng lam a hawi lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khaw ro leh lumin vûrtui a tiral a, Seol-in thil tisualte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chhûlin a theihnghilh a, changpâtin tui takin a ei a, Hriat reng a ni tawh lo vang a, Suahsualna chu thing angin a tliak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ching, fa hring lo chu a ei a, Hmeithai thil ṭha a tihsak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian chuan a chaknain thiltitheite nun chu a tisei a, Dam an beisei loh hnu pawhin an tho chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himna a siamsak a, tah chuan an châwl a, An kawngah chuan a mitte a fu reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chawisân an ni a, rei lo têan an ral a; Mi dang angin an vuai a, an chuai a, Buh vui anga ah chhumin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tûnah chuti ni suh sela, tu nge daw mi ti thei anga, Ka ṭawng kha eng mah lovah sawi thei ang?
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Bildada, Suhi mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnênah chuan rorêlna leh hlauhawmna a awm a, A hmun sângahte chuan remna a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sipai rualte chu chhiar rual em ni? Tu chungah nge a êng a chhuah loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engtin nge Pathian hmaah mi a fel theih ang le? Engtin nge hmeichhe hrin a thianghlim theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, thla meuh pawh khian ênna a nei nêm, Arsite pawh a mit hmuhah chuan an thianghlim lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihring lek phei chu e, thil lung mai a ni! Mihring fapa chu changpât mai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chakna nei lo mi chu i va han pui ve le! Thahrui nei lo bân chu i va han chhan ve le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Finna nei lo chu i han zilh fing a, Hriatna ṭha tak i sawi hnem teh e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu hnênah nge thu i chhâk chhuaha, Tu thlarau nge i hnên ata lo chhuak ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thi tawhte an khûr a, Tuite leh a chhûnga chêngte hnuaiah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hmaah chuan Seol chu saruak a ni a, Abadon chuan khuhna a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmun ruakah chuan hmâr a tipharh a, Lei chu eng mah lovah a khai kâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A chhûm chhah tak chuan tuite a fûn khâwm a, A hnuaia chhûm chu a keh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lalṭhutthlêng hma chu a khuh a, A chungah chhûm a zîntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tui ramri a siam a, Thim leh êng thlen chinte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vân dona bante chu a nghîng dur dur a, A zilhhauna chu mak an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thiltihtheihnain tuipui a tingawi a, A hriat thiamnain Rahab chu a tan chhum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thawin vân chu a tithiang a, A kutin rûlpui tlân chak chu a thil tlang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh, hêng hi a kawng pâwn lam lek a ni, A chanchin kan hriat hi a va beitham êm! A thiltihtheihna ri thâwm chu tu nge hre zo thei ang?
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan a thusawi a chhunzawm a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thiamna thu la botu, ka thlarau tilungngaitu, Pathian, Engkimtitheia chu nung na pui!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Keimahah hian ka thaw a la kim a, ka hnârah Pathian thaw a la châm;)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hmuiin fel lohna thu a phuh chhuak tawp lo vang, Ka leiin bumna thu a sawi hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thiam ka chantîr dâwn teuh lo mai che u, Ka thih thlengin ka dikna ka dah bo lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka felna chu ka chelh tlat ang a, ka thlah lo vang; Ka nun chhûng hian ka thinlungin mi dem lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hmêlma chu mi suaksual ni sela, Mi beitu chu mi fel lo lo ni teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak lo tân beiseina eng nge awm, Pathianin a sah chhuma a thlarau a lâk si chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Buainain a nan laiin Pathianin a au thâwm a ngaithla ang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engkimtitheiaah chuan a lâwm ang em? Pathian chu eng lai pawhin a ko vang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian kut chungchâng ka zirtîr ang che u, Engkimtitheia hnêna awm chu ka zêp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai ru, nangni ngeiin in vaiin in hmu a, Engti ziaa khawlo cheu nge in nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian hnêna mi suaksual chanvo chu hei hi a ni, Hnehchhiahtute ro chan, Engkimtitheia hnên aṭanga an dawn chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A fate an pun chuan khandaih tuar tûr lekfang an ni; A rîla rahten chaw khamkhawp pawh an nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hnua dam chhunte chu hriin a phûm ang a, An nupuite pawhin an sûn lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tangkaruate vaivut angin a khâwl a, Hlum ang maiin a silhfênte a tiang khâwm na a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tiang khâwm mah se, mi fel chuan a sinsak ang a, Pawi khawih lote chuan tangkarua chu an insem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maimawm angin a in chu a sa a, Vêngtuin chhâwl bûk a siam ang lekin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hausain a mu a; mahse, a tho tawh lâwng; A mit a han meng a, a awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui lian angin hlauhawmin a nang a, Zânah thlipuiin a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khawchhak thliin a lên bo va, a bo ta a, A hmun ata a nuai bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zahngai lovin a nuai ang a, A thiltihtheihna hmaah chuan a kat rawk rawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kut a ben khum ang a, A chek khum ang a, a hmun ata a ûm chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tangkaraw laih chhuahna khur a awm a, Rangkachak tihthianghlimna hmun pawh a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei ata thîr lâk chhuah a ni a, Lung ata dâr rawh tui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miten thim an titâwp a, Hmun hla berte pawh an zawng chhuak a, Thim chhah tak leh thihna daihlima lungte pawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite chên lohnaah khur an lai a, A chunga kal vêlten an theihnghilh a, Mi hlatnaah an inkhai a, an inthên an inthên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lei hi chaw lo chhuahna a ni a, A chhûng chu mei kan anga chawh leh a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuta lungte chu saphir hmun a ni a, Rangkachak nawite a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu kawng chu sa hel ei vâten an hre lo va, Mu mit pawhin a hmu bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ramsa ngêng ngalhte pawhin an rap ngai lo va, Tah chuan sakeibaknei kawlh a kal ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi chuan lung chang takah a kut a thlâk a, Tlâng lian pui pui, a bul nên lam a hai let a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungpuite a verh tlang seng sung a, Thil hlu tinrêng a mitin a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pût hauh lovin luite a khuap chat a, Thil inthupte êngah a la chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahse, khaw nge finna hmuhna tûr chu? Hriatna awmna hmun chu khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihringin a man chin a hre lo va, Mi nung ramah hmuh a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thûkna chuan, “Keimahah a awm lo,” a ti a, Tuipui chuan, “Ka hnênah a awm lo,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rangkachaka lei theih a ni lo va, A man atân tangkarua bûk chhuah mi a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ophir rangkachakin a tluk thei lo va, Oniks lunghlu emaw, saphir emaw pawhin a tluk thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rangkachak leh lung fîmin a tluk lo va, Rangkachak thianghlim chei mawiin thleng theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koral te, krustal te, sawi rual a awm lo, A ni, finna man chu lunghlu aiin a chungnung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ethiopia topaz pawhin a khan lo va, Rangkachak thianghlim nên khaikhin rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nih, finna chu khawi ata nge? Hriatna awmna hmun chu khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thinlung zawng zawng mit lakah thup a ni a, Chunglêng savate lakah khâr tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Boralna leh Thihna chuan, “A thâwm zawng kan bengin kan hria,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathianin a kawng chu a hria a, A awmna hmun pawh a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei tâwp thlengin a thlîr a, Vân hnuai pum pui hi a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thli chakna a pêk lai khân, A ni, tuite pawh tehnaa a teh chhuah lai khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ruahtui tân dân a siam lai khân, Khawpui ri, kâwlphe tân kawng a siam lai khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan a hmu a, a puang a, A tinghet a, a ni, a zawng chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, mihring hnênah, “Ngai rawh, Lalpa ṭih hi, hei ngei hi finna a ni, Thil ṭha lo kalsan hi hriat thiamna a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan a thusawi a chhunzawm a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, tûn hma thla ral taahte khân awm ni ila, Pathianin mi vên lai niahte khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khâwnvâr ka lu chungah a êng ṭhîn a, Thimah pawh a êng ringin ka kal tlang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka vânglai nite ka hman laia, Pathian pâwlna ka puan ina a awm lai khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engkimtitheia ka hnêna a awm ṭhin laia, Ka fate ka vêla an awm lai khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kalnate hnute khala chulh a nih laia, Lungpuiin ka tân hriak a luan chhuahtîr dûl dûl lai khân!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui kawngka pana ka kala, Kawtthlêra ṭhutna ka buatsaih laite khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlangvâlten mi hmu a, an biru a, Upate an tho va, an ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hotute chu an ṭawng lai an châwl a, An kutin an kâ an hup a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi liante aw a reh a, An dang chungah an lei a bet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benga hriaten nihlawh mi ti a. Mita hmuten mi hriatpui a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi rethei ṭap ka chhan chhuah ṭhin avângin. Pa nei lo, puitu nei lote pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Boral dâwn ṭêpte malsâwmna ka chungah a thleng a, Hmeithai thinlung pawh hlimin ka zaitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Felna chu ka inbel a, mi tuam vêl a, Ka tihdik ṭhinzia hi kawrfual leh lukhum ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitdel tân mit ka ni a, Kebai tân ke ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlachham tân pa ka ni a, Ka hmêlhriat lohte pawh an thu ka buaipui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi fel lo ngho chu ka titliak a, A haa a thil seh chu ka pawt chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, “Ka bu zâwlah ka thi ang a, Ka nîte chu ṭiauvut angin ka tipung ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui lamahte ka zung a zâm darh ang a, Zankhuain ka zârah dai a châm reng ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ropuina hi keimahah a thar reng ang a, Ka kutah ka thal ngul pawh a thar reng,” ka ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lamah miten beng an dawh a, an ngaithla a, Ka thu nghâkin an ngawi ṭhap ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka sawi zawhah an ṭawng ve tawh ngai lo; Ka thusawi chu an chungah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ruahtui angin mi nghâk reng ṭhîn, Ruah hnuhnûng châk angin an ka an lo âng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An inrinhlelh laiin ka nuihpui a, Ka hmêl hlim chu an tihnual lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An kawng ka thlang a, hotuah ka ṭhu a, Sipai rual zîngah lalber angin ka awm a, Lusûnte thlamuantu angin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûnah zawng ka aia nauten mi nuihzat a, An pate ka ran rual vêngtu ui zînga telah pawh ka duh lohte khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni, chûng thaṭhum mite chu, An kut thahrui ka hnemhnânpui em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tlachham leh rilṭâmin an chêr a, Ram ro leh kawlh chu an khel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnim buk hnah nêmte an thliak a, Juniper zungte an chaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihring zîng ata hnawh bovin an awm a, Rûkru angin an au zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruam kumkârahte an chêng a, Lei khuarkhurum leh lungpui pûkahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnim buk zîngahte an chiau va, Ṭaiṭên hnuaiahte chuan an tawm khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi âte fa an ni, a ni, tlâktlâi lo ber fate; Ram ata vuak chhuah an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah zawng an hla ka lo ni ta; A ni, an kamchhe tleuhna mai ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Min ten a, an inthiar fihlîm a; Ka hmaia chil chhâk pawh an tîm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hruihrual chu a phelha, mi nghaisak tâk avângin, Ka hmaah insûmkârna an thlah ṭhak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ding lamah mi rûrâho an lo thawk a; Ka ke an nêk per a, An tihchhiatna kawng chu ka chungah an din a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka kawng an tichhia a, Ka vânduaina an tizual a, Tu mân an dâl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pawp zau laiah an lo kal a, A chim zîngah mi hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ṭihbaiawm ka chungah a thleng a, Ka ropuina chu thlî angin an ûm bo va, Ka mi ṭhatna chu chhûm angin a rîral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keimah ata ka thlarau leih chhuah a ni; Chhiatna nite chuan mi man ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zânah chuan ka ruhte a kher ngut ngut a, Ka na mi fêp sup sup hi a châwl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka na hian ka silhfênte a tikhawlo va, Ka kawrnghâwng angin mi rêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chirhdiakah chuan mi paih lût a, Vaivut leh vut ang mai ka ni ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang ka au che a, mi chhâng lo va, Ka ding a, nangin mi hawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lakah i nun a lo râwng ta a, I kut chakin mi tiduhdah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangin thlîah mi chawi kâng a, a chungah mi chuantîr a; Nangin thlipuiah mi tiral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangin thihna mi thlen ang tih ka hria asin, Mi nung zawng zawng tâna ruat inah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chim chhe vûm chungah miin a kut a phar ngeiin, A vânduainaah chuan ṭanpui dîlin a au dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Buaina tâwkte tân ka ṭap ṭhîn lâwm ni? Chhambalte tân ka lungngai ṭhîn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thil ṭha ka zawng a, thil chhia a lo thleng a, Êng ka nghâk a, thim a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thin a phu hlawp hlawp a, a reh thei lo va, Tuarna nîte chu ka chungah a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ni em vâng ni lovin ka dum a, Pungkhâwmho zînga dingin ṭanpui ka dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kâwl-uite tân unaupa ka ni a, Ostrich-te tân ṭhian ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka vun chu a lo dum a, a khawk a, Ka ruhte chu a lum vut vut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan ka perhkhuang ri chu sûnnaah a chang a, Ka phênglâwng chu ṭap râwlah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mit tân thuthlung ka siam a; Engah nge nula ka melh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chunga Pathian laka chanvo leh Chungnung ber Engkimtitheia laka ro chan tûr chu eng nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi fel lo tâna vânduaina leh, Khawlohna titute tâna chhiatna a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kawngte chu a hmuin, Ka ke pên zawng zawng a chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dâwt lama kal ka niha, Bumna lama ka ke pên rang ṭhîn ka nih chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Bûkna dik taka tehin awm ila, Ka dikna hi Pathianin a hriat nân.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, kawng lova pêng ka lo niha, Ka mit hmuh ang maia thinlung pu ka lo niha, Ka kutah hian kaidum rêng a bei phawt chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tuh chu mi dangin ei mai ang hmiang; Ka chîn zawng pawh kar chhuah ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thinlung hian hmeichhia a îta, Ka ṭhenawm kawngkâah châng te ka nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nupui chuan mi dang sum dêng sela, Mi dangte chuan tlâwm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chu sual huatthlala tak, Khawlohna, rorêltuten an hrem ngei tûr chu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ral dêr khawpa kângtu mei a ni bawk a, Ka sum neih zawng zawng pawh a khawrh fai vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawhnu emaw, ka chhiahhlawhpa emaw, Ka chunga an vuivaina thu thlen ka ngaihsak loh luih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian a lo thawh hunah eng nge ka tih tâk ang le? A rawn zawh chian hunah engtin nge ka chhân ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pum chhûnga kei mi siamtu khân ani pawh a siam lo vem ni? Pum chhûnga mi dintu chu thuhmun a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlachhamte duh zâwng ka sûm bosaka, Hmeithaite bei ka tihdawna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka chaw keimah maia ka eia, Fahrahin a ei ve loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(A naupan lai aṭangin pa angin ka châwm lian a, A nu pum aṭangin ka kaihhruai a ni tawh si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu pawh silhfên lova boral emaw, rethei intuamhlâwmna nei lo emaw hmu ka niha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kâwngin mal mi sâwm lo a nih chuan, Ka berâm hmula tuam lum a nih loh chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kawngkâah chuan ṭanpuitu ka hmuh avânga, Fahrah chunga kut lek ka nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka koki hi ka dâr saiphêng nên phawk hlawk sela, Ka bân hi khingkhangruh aṭangin thlawn hlauh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian lak ata vânduaina chu ka ṭihzâwng tak a ni si a. A ropuina avângin eng ti rual ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rangkachak chu ka nghahfâka ka hmana, Rangkachak ṭha mi chu ka rinchhana ka ngaiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hausakna a nasat avâng leh Ka kutin a thawh chhuah nasat avânga lâwm ka lo niha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nî khi a ên lai leh Thla kal ruau ruau lam ka hawia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thinlung hi a rûk têa hîp bo a niha, Ka kut pawhin ka kâ a hup chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu pawh chu rorêltute hrem ngei tûr khawlohna a ni a, Chunga Pathian hnêna daw ka nih dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi hawtu chhiatna chunga lâwm ka nih emawa, Thil ṭha lovin a tlâkbuak laia lâwm hlut ka nih emaw chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />(A ni, a nunna ânchhe lawh khawpa sual ti tûrin ka kâ ka phal lo.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka puan ina mite chuan, “A buhbâla inhnangfâk lo tu nge awm?” an tih loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />(Mikhualte kawtthlêrah an riak lo va, Mi zin vâkte tân ka kawng ka hawng ṭhîn.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mite tih dân anga ka bawhchhiatna zêpa, Mahni âwm chhûnga khawlohna thukruin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipui tam takte hlauh avâng leh chhûngkuate hmuhsit hlauh avânga ngawi reng leh lêng chhuak ngam lo ka nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aw, mi bengkhawntu nei teh ila aw! (En teh u, hei ka chhinchhiahna ka dah e, Engkimtitheian mi chhâng teh se.) Ka khingpuipan mi hêkna a ziak chu nei teh ila aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka kokîah ka pu ang a, Lallukhum angin ka inbel tûr a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka pheikhai zât pawh ka hrilh ang a, Mi lian ni ve angin amah ka pan tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka ram chu mi duh lova au chhuak a niha, A lei rûtkhuarte an ṭap hlawm a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Man pe lova a rah chhuahte ei ka lo niha, A neitute nun hlohtîr emaw ka lo nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Buh aiah hlîng ṭo zâwk sela, Ṭai aiah hlo har ṭo rawh se. Joba thu chu a tâwp ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, hêng mi pathumte hian Joba chu an chhâng zêl ta lo va, fel a intih êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Barakela fapa Elihua, Buz mi, Ram thlahho zînga mi chu a thinrim ta êm êm mai a; Pathian ai maha amah thiam a inchantîr avângin Joba chungah chuan a thin a rim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joba ṭhian pathumte chungah pawh chuan a thinrim bawk a, Joba chu thiam lo an ti chunga chhân ngaihna an hriat loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chu a aia upa an nih avângin Elihua chu Joba hnênah thu sawi ve lovin a lo inkhêk reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Elihua chuan hêng mi pathumte hian chhân ngaihna rêng an hre ta lo tih a hriatin a thinur ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Barakela fapa Elihua, Buz mi chuan a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a: Ka naupang a, nangni in upa a, Chuvâng chuan ka tîm a, Ka ngaih dân pawh ka hrilh ngam lo che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Khua reiin hril sela, Kum tamin finna zirtîr teh se,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, mi thil hriat thiamtîrtu chu mihringa thlarau awm, Engkimtitheia thaw chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kum tam hi an fing chuang lo va, Upaten thu dik an hre thiam chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, “Mi ngaithla ula, Ka ngaih dân ka han sawi teh ang,” ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in thu ka nghâk reng a, Sawi tûr in dap thleng khân, In ṭan dânah beng ka lo chhi reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni, ngun takin ka ngaithla che u a, Ngai rawh u, Joba hnial hneh thei emaw, A thu letthla thei emaw in zîngah tu mah in awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fîmkhur rawh u; “Fing tak kan tâwk a lo ni, Mihring ni lovin, Pathian chauhvin a hneh thei ang,” In ti rawk ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thuin kei mi la vawm ve lo va, In tih dân ang maiin ka chhâng dâwn hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An inkhâp thlu dêr a, an dan reng hi, Kam khat mah sawi tûr an nei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dang renga dinga an chhân tawh loh avâng hian, Kei pawhin ka nghâk ve reng dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima pualin ka chhâng ang a, Ka ngaih dân ka han sawi teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu lah ka ngah hle si a, Chhûng lam rilruin mi tur nasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, ka thinlung hi uain hu chhuahna nei lo ang a ni a. Uain peng thar angin a puak dâwn ṭêp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuin ka inhrithla dâwn e, Ka kâ ka âng ang a, ka chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu mah ka zahpah lo mai ang a, Tu mah ka fak der hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Fak der ka thiam si lo va; Chuti lo chu, mi Siamtuin mi la bo thuai mai ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eng pawh ni se, Joba, ka ṭawng hi ngaithla la, Ka thu zawng zawngah hian beng lo chhi teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, hei ka kâ ka âng ta a, ka leiin thu a sawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thute chuan ka thinlung ngîlzia a tilang a, Ka hmui chuan a thil hriat chu dik takin a sawi dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian thlarau chuan mi siam a, Engkimtitheia thaw chuan nunna mi pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I theih chuan mi chhâng la, Ṭan khawh la, ka hmaah hian I thute chu siam rem rawh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh, Pathian lam thûah chuan, Nangmah ang bawk ka ni a, Hluma siam ve bawk ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, kei hi mi hlau suh la, Ka nawr lutuk lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka beng hriatah i sawi tawh tak a, I thu ri chu ka lo hre tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka thiang a ni, bawhchhiatna nei lovin; Ka fihlîm a ni, khawlohna nei lovin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I e, ka chungah remchâng a dap chhuak a, A hmêlmaah mi chhiar a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka keah kawl mi bun a, Ka kalna zawng zawng a chhui chhuak a ni,” i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka chhâng ang che, Hetah hian i fel zo zân lo ve; Pathian chu mihring aiin a ropui zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu khat mah a chhân loh avângin Engah nge amah i beih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathianin kawng khatin thu a sawi ṭhîn a, A ni, kawng hnih pawhin, pawisak loh pawh ni se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mumangah, zân inlârnaah chuan Mite tui taka an muthilha, Khumlaizâwla an mut chiah chiah laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mite beng chu a tihawng a, An thu dawn chu a tinghet a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihring chu a thiltih ṭhulhtîra, A chapona chu a thupsak theih nân;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu thlâna liam lovin a vawng a, A nun pawh khandaih laka boral lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A khum laizâwlah natnaa thununin a awm a, A ruh zawng zawng na sup supin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, chaw te a hua a, Sa tui hmêl takte pawh a duh lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tisa a lo chêr deuh deuh va, hmuh tham a ni lo va, Ruh hlîr ruh hlîr a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan thihna kotlâng a hnaih a, A nun chuan tiboraltute a hnaih tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi hnêna a tâna ṭha hriattîr tûrin A tân vântirhkoh, palai pakhat, Sâng zînga mi awm sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chuan amah duhsak takin, “Thlâna liam lovin chhan him ang che, Tlanna ka hmu ta e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A taksa hi tleirâwl thar leh sela, A vânglai chakna nite chu lo kîr leh tawh se,” ti sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu mi chu Pathian hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, Ani chuan a lo pawm a. A hmêl chu hlim takin a hmu ang a. Anin a hnênah felna chu a pe leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mite hmaah hla sain: “Ka sual a, thil dik chu ka tikhawlo va; Mahse, mi thungrûl lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thlâna liam lo tûrin mi chhan him a, Ka nunin khaw êng a lo hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ngai rawh, mihringin nunna êng a hmuh theih nâna Thlân ata hruai kîr tûrin, Pathianin hêng thil zawng zawng hi, Mihring hnênah vawi hnih vawi thum a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />E, Joba, ngun takin mi ngaithla teh, Lo ngawi la, ka han sawi ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sawi tûr i neih chuan mi chhâng la, Sawi rawh, thiam chantîr che ka duh a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuti a nih loh chuan, mi ngaithla rawh, Lo ngawi la, finna ka zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Elihua chuan a sawi zêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangni mi fingte u, ka thute ngaithla ula, Nangni mi thiamte u, in beng dawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kâin ei mi a hria angin, Bengin thu a thliar a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan tâna dik chu thlang ila, A ṭha chu keimahniin i chian ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joba chuan, “Fel zawng ka fel a ni, Pathianin ka thiamna mi hnâwlsakin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thiam reng chung hi dawtheiah mi chhiar mai pawh a; Bawhchhiatna ka nei lo chungin Ka hliam chu tihdam rual a ni lo,” a ti si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joba ang hi tu nge awm, Tui anga deuna ina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawlohna titute pâwla, Mi suaksualte nêna lêng ṭhîn chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Pathian chunga lâwm hi Mihringin engah mah a sâwtpui lo ve,” a ti vei nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni, mi rilru neite u, Mi ngaithla rawh u, Pathian chuan thil suaksual tiin, Engkimtitheia chuan thil dik lo chu a ti teuh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite an thiltih ang zêlin a thungrûl ang a, Mi tin an awm dân ang zêlin an chungah a thlentîr dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni, Pathian chuan suaksual takin a ti lul lo vang a, Engkimtitheia chuan a rêl khawlo hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu nge lei hi amah awptîra, Khawvêl pum pui hi a hnêna kawltîr ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama thlarau chu a hnêna a lâk kîra, Ama thaw chu a hnêna a lâk khâwm leh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi nung zawng zawng an boral rual ang a, Mihring chu vaivutah a chang leh mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hriat thiamna i neih chuan hei hi ngaithla la, Ka ṭawng ri hi bengkhawn rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu dik hawtu chuan ro a rêl ang em ni? Mi fel leh thiltitheia chu thiam loh i chantîr ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu lalber hnêna, “Tlâktlailopa,” Mi lian hnêna, “Suaksualpa,” titu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hotute pawh duhsak bîk lo leh, Mi rethei aia mi hausa ngaihsak chuang lo a ni a, An zain a kutchhuak an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mit khap kâr lovah an thi a, Zanlaiah mite an khûr a, an ral a, Mi chakte pawh kut lova lâk bovin an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihring awm dân chungah mit a lên a, A pheikhai zawng zawng a hmu vek si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawlohna titute an bihrûk theihna tûr Thim a awm lo va, thihna daihlim a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian hmaa rorêlnaa kal tûrin Mihring tân hun bi a ruat si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi chakte chu a tiṭiau va, an thu rêl lovin, An hmunah mi dangte a dah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an thiltihte chu hriain, Zânah anmahni a tichhia a, a nuai bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mite mit hmuhah anni chu Mi sual hremin a hrem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama laka an pên bo avâng leh, A dânte an pawisak loh avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A beng thleng khawp khawpin retheite an rûmtîr a, Ani chuan hnehchhiahte au thâwm chu a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani chu lo ngawi sela tu nge thiam loh chantîr thei ang? A hmêl a thup laiin tuin nge hmu thei ang? Hnam tân emaw, mi mal tân emaw thuhmun a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian hre lo mi chuan ro a rêl lohna tûr leh Mipui an âwkai loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Miin Pathian hnênah chuan, “Pawi ka khawih lo na a, hremna ka tuar si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka hmuh loh chu mi zirtîr la, Khawlohna ka tih pawhin, Ka ti tawh lo vang,” a ti ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian thungrulhna chu i duh ang kher em ni dâwn a, I lo hnial ni? Kei ni lovin nangin i thlang tûr a ni; Chuvângin, i hriat chu sawi rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mi rilru neite leh mi fingte, Mi ngaithla apiang pawhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Joba hi chinchâng hre lovin a ṭawng mai mai a ni e, A thûah hian finna a awm lo ve,” mi tihpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Joba hi mi sual ṭawnga a ṭawng avâng hian Fiah fai vekin awm se ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A sual belhchhahin a hel a, Kan zîngah a kut a bêng a, Pathian chungah a thu a tuitam mai a nih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Elihua chuan a sawi zêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hei hi dikah i ngai em, “Pathian hmaah ka fel a ni,” i tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thil tisual lo ila ka tân ṭhat chuanna eng nge awma, Ka tân hlâwkna eng nge awm chuang?” i tih te hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka han chhâng teh ang che, Nang leh i pâwlpuite nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vân lam dâk la, en teh, Chhûmte khi en la, nang aia a sân zâwk khi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil i tihsual pawhin, a tân eng nge pawi? I bawhchiatna a pun pawhin, a tân eng nge pawi ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I fel pawhin, a tân hnemhnânpui tûr i awm em ni? I kut ata eng nge a dawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I suahsualna chuan nang ang mihring chauh a khawih a, I felna chuan mihring fa chauh a khawih thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnehchhiahna a tam avângin an rûm a, Mi chakte bân avângin chhan ngaiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahse, tu mân, “Min siamtu Pathian chu khawiah nge, Zâna hla min saktîrtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnuailêngte aia min zirtîr hnem zâwktu, Chunglêngte aia finga min siamtu chu?” an ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tah chuan an rûm a, tu mân an chhâng lo, Mi sualte chapona avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin dîlna lawi lo chu a ngaithla lo vang a, Engkimtitheian a ngaihsak hek lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang lek phei chu e! “Amah ka hmu lo ve, Thu rêl tûr chu a hmaah a awm reng a, Amah ka nghâk reng e,” i han ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûnah hian thinrima a rawn hrem mai loh avâng leh, Uanthuanna a rawn pawisak mai loh avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joba hian a kâ a âng mai mai a, Chinchâng hre lovin a thu a tuitam mai a nih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihua chuan a sawi zêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngawi rih la, ka kawhhmuh ang che; Pathian hmingin sawi tûr ka la nei cheu a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hriatna ka han fawm khâwm vak teh ang, Mi siamtu chu felna ka bel dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thu a daw hauh lo a nia, Hriatna famkim nei chu i kiangah a awm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai rawh, Pathian chu chak tak a ni a, Tu mah a hmusit mai lo; Rilru chaknaah chuan a ropui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi suaksual chu a zuah lo va, Hnehchhiahte erawh chu dik takin a rêlsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi felte chu a ensan lo va, Lalṭhuthlênga lalte kiangah Kumkhuain a ṭhuttîr a, Chawimawiin an awm zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kawl bun an lo niha, Hnehchhiahna hruia phuar an lo nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An thiltih leh an bawhchhiatnate a entîr a, An lo chapo tawhziate nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zirtîrna lamah an beng a tivâr a, Khawlohna lakah an inlamlêt nân thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An pawisaka a rawng an bâwl chuan, An nite chu hmuingîl takin an hmang ral ang a, An kumte chu nuam takin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An pawisak loh erawh chuan khandaihin an boral ang a, Hriatna lovin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thinlunga Pathian zah lo mite chuan thinur an khâwl a, Ama phuar an nih pawhin ṭanpui dîlin an au lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi bawlhhlawhte zîngah chuan an vânglaiin an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan hrehawm tuartu chu A hrehawmna hmangin a tichhuak a, Hnehchhiahna hmangin a beng a tivâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni, manganna ata chu hmun zau tak, Nêkchêp lohnaah chuan a hruai chhuak ang chia, I chawhlui chu thauvin a khat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, nang chu mi suaksualte sawisêlnain i khat a, Sawisêlna leh rorêl dikna chuan a man che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thinur avângin hmuhsitna rilru i pu dah ang e, Tlanna man nasatzia hian hruai bo che suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Manganga i awm loh nân i awkâ emaw, I thahrui chakna emaw a tâwk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zân chu châk suh, mite an hmun ata an boralna hun a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Fîmkhur la, khawlohna lam hawi suh, Hei hi hrehawm tuar aia i thlan a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai rawh, Pathian chuan a theihnain zo takin a ti a ni; Tu nge amah ang zirtîrtu awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu nge a tih dân tûr ruatsak? Tu nge, “I ti dik lo,” ti thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hnathawh tiropui tûrin hre reng rawh, Miten zaia an chawi ṭhina chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi tinin chu chu an en a, Miten hla tak aṭangin an thlîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngai rawh, Pathian chu a ropui e, Kan lo hre lo pawh a; A kum zât te chu zawn chhuah rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tui mal far tê tê chu a hîp chho va, Tuihûa intifîmin ruahah a chang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vânin a sûrtîr a, Mihring chungah a tla buan buan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ni, chhûm ṭai darh dân te hi mihringin a hre thei em ni? A bûk zâr ri dur dur te hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngai teh, a vêlah a êng a theh darh a, Tuifinriat mawngte a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hêng hian mite thu a rêlsak a, Ei tûr tam tak a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kâwlphein a kutte chu a khuh a, A tum tak fuh tûrin a tîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khawpui ri chuan a chungchâng a puang a, Ran rualte pawhin thlipui lo thawkah chuan an puang a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei vâng hian ka thinlung a khûr a, A phu hlawp hlawp asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngaithla ngun ula, a awrâwl te leh A kâa lo chhuak rite chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vân pum pui hnuaiah a tîr chhuak a, A kâwlphe chu lei tâwp thleng thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hnuah chuan a awrâwl a chhuah a, A ropuina aw chu a tiri dur dur a; A aw an hriat pawhin a chawlhtîr chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chuan mak takin a aw a tiri dur dur a, Thil ropui tak, kan hriat phâk loh a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vûr hnênah chuan, “Leiah tla rawh,” a ti a, Chutiang bawk chuan ruah leh ruahpuite hnênah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tinrêng kut chu a tikhawng zo va, A mi siam zawng zawngten an hriat nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ramsaten bîk bona an pan a, An bu zâwlah an awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhim lam pindan ata thli chhia a lo thawk a, Hmâr lam ata khaw vâwt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian thaw vângin tuikhal a lo awm a, Tui zau tak pawh a khal zo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni, chhûm chhah puite chu hnâwngin a tikhat a, Chhûmah chuan kâwlphe a tidarh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama hruaiin an vir zawr zawr a, Khawvêl chên theihna zawng chungah hian, A thupêk apiang an tih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zilh nân emaw, a ram ṭhat nân emaw, Zahngaih vâng emawa a rawn awmtîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joba, hei hi ngaichâng teh, Bengsikin Pathian thiltih makte chu ngaihtuah teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng chu Pathianin thu a pêk dân leh, A chhûma kâwl a phêttîr dânte i hria em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhûm a kân theih dân te, Hriatna famkim neitu thiltih makte hi i hria em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhim thli avânga lei a reh ṭhiapa, I silhfên a lo lumzia te hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu vân i kaih pharhpui thei em ni? Dârthlalang chhûn khal ang maia khauh chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnêna kan sawi tûr chu min hriattîr rawh le; Thimna avângin kan sawi thiam loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sawi dâwn tih amah hrilh tûr em ni? Mahni intihboral miin a châk ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûnah, thli a lo thâwta a chhêm kianin, Vân zâwla êng ropui chu miin an en ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmâr aṭangin rangkachak êng a lo zâm a, Pathian chu ropui râpthlâk takin a inthuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkimtitheia chu kan hmu chhuak thei lo va, Thiltihtheihna leh diknaah a ropui a, Felna a ngah a, a hnehchhiah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, miten amah an ṭih a, Intifingte chu tu mah a pawisa chuang lo ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ṭhâwngaleivir aṭangin Joba chu a chhâng a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hriatna tel lo thua Thurâwn tithimtu hi tu nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipa takin i puan veng la, Thu ka zâwt ang chia, mi hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung nghahchhan ka phûm lai khân khawiah nge i awm? I hriat thiam chuan sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A len lam bî te tu nge thliah? I hre meuh maw! A nih leh, a chung zâwl tehna tu nge zam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A nghahchhan chu khawiah nge a din ngheha, Tu nge a kil lung phûm ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vârparh arsite an zai khâwma, Pathian fate zawng zawng an au lai khân?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipui chu chhûla a lo chhuah lai khân Tuin nge kawng lo khâr hnan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A silhfên atân chhûm ka siam a, A tuam puanah thim chhah tak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chîm chin tûr te ka siam a, A danna leh khârna tûr te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Heti thleng chauh hian lo kal la, pêl hauh suh, Tah hian i fâwn vêl tâwp rawh se,” ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei khuhna tikianga, Mi suaksualte thing chhuak tûrin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I pian achinah, zîng hnênah thu i pein, Khawfîngchat hi a hmun tûr i hriattîr ngai em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lei hi nemnaa hlum nem angin a tilang dang a, Silhfên ze hrang ang nukin a lang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi suaksualte êng chu chhuhsak a ni a, An bân lek sân chu tihtliah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipui hnârahte i lût tawh ngai em? A thûkzia te i fang chhuak tawh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thihna kawngkate chu i hnênah tihlan a ni tawh em? Thihna daihlim kawngkâ chu i hmu tawh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lei zauzia te hi i hre phâk em ni? I hriat vek chuan sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An ramri i hruai theiha, An in lam kawng chin i hriat theihna tûr chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Êng chênna kawng chu khawiah nge? Thim pawh chu khawiah nge a hmun?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hria ang chu, chûngah chuan i piang tawh a, I nîte pawh a tam tawh alâwm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vûr dah khâwlna hmunah i lût tawhin, Rial dah khâwlna hmunah pawh i lût tawh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Buai hun atân te leh indo leh inbeih nî atâna ka khêk chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eng kawngin nge êng hi a ṭai darha, Chhak lam thli pawh hi lei chungah a intheh darh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin nge ruahpui tâna luan kawr leh, Ṭêk tâna kawng siam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu ma awm lohna leh mihring chên lohna Thlalêra ruah surtîr tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ram ro leh pilril tihnâwng tûr te, Hlobet hring ṭotîr tûr tein?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ruahin pa a nei em ni? Daifîmte hi tu hrin nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu chhûl aṭangin nge vûr khal hi a lo chhuah? Vân aṭanga vûr lo tla ṭhîn hi tu hrin nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuite pawh lung ang maiin a sak a, Tuipui thûk chungte a khal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siruk khi i phuar khâwm theiin, Chhohreivûng tlar khi i phelh darh thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Arsite khi a hun bîah i hruai chhuak thei em ni? Zângkhuahote khi i hruai thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vân thil ruatte chu i hriain, Leiah hian thu i neihtîr thei em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A nan tûr chein chhûm ata Ruahpui vânawn i au thla thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kâwlphê te chu i hnêna lo kala, “Heta hi kan awm,” ti tûrin i tîr chhuak thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu nge chhûm dumahte khian finna daha, Tu nge arsi thlâwkte hriat thiamna pe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tu nge finnaa chhûmte hi chhiar theia, Vân tuithâwl tu nge leih baw thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Vaivutte a inhlâwm khâwma, Lei tlangte a inbelhbawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sakeibaknei tân ei tûr i zawnsakin, Sakeibaknei vânglaite châk daih i pe thei em ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An pûkahte an bawha, Seh tûr an chân lai hian?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Choâk hi, a note ei tûr tlachhama, Pathian hnêna an hrâm lai leh An vahvaih laiin tuin nge chaw pe?
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lung bang sathâr no neih hun i hria em ni? Sazuk no neih hun i chhinchhiah thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An pai chhûng thla zât i chhiarin, An hrin hun te i hria em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An bawk a, no an hring a, An vei zo mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An note chu an pian a tlang a, Ram palailêngah an ṭhang lian a, An kal darh a, an puite hnênah an kîr tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram sabengtung tuin nge se zâwl chhuah? Ram sabengtung chak thlunna tu phelh nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An awm nân thlalêr ka ruatsak a, An chên nân ram ṭau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui hulûm chu a hmusit a, Khalhtu au ri a hre ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tlatna chu tlâng dungah a ni a, Thil hring apiang a zawng chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I tân selepa chu chhawr theih em ni ang? I ran inah a riak duh ang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei lehnaah hrui i bahtîr thei ang em? I hnungah lei ruam a rawn chawk rual ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A chak êm avâng maiin i ring thei dâwn em ni? I hna chu i kawltîr dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I buhte i hruih zâwla rawn dah khâwm tûrin I ring mai thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ostrich thla uangthuang takin a inkhawng vêl a; Mahse, a thla ki leh a hmulte chu an ngilnei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leiah a tui a hnutchhiah a, Vaivutah a khuh lum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miin a rap keh thei a, Ramsaten an chil keh thei tih a hre leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama no ni lo ang hrimin a note lakah a inchhu ngawng a, A thiltih chu a thlâwn dâwn emaw, a pawisa chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathianin finna a haihchhamtîra, Hriat thiamna a pêk hek loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlân bo tuma a han insingsak meuh chuan, Sakawr leh a chung chuangte chu a tham lo mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakawr chaknate hi i pêk em ni? A nghâwngah thahrui i bân em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khau anga kat tûrin i siam em ni? A hnâr tum dur dur hlauhawmzia te hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phai ruamah a ke a phiat tlut tlut a, A tha a so va, indo hriamhrei hmachhawn tûrin a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hlauh rêng a hre lo va, a zâm ngai lo va, Khandaih lakah a tîm ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A chungah thal bâwm a ri rawk rawk a, Fei leh thal a tle zawr zawr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hlauhawm tak leh thinur takin a khawh puat puat a, Tawtawrâwt thâwmah a ding hle hle thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt a rîk phawt chuan “Chei! Chei!” a ti a, Inbeihna chu hla takah a rim a hria a, Hotute râwl leh inbeihna hawhaw nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I finna avângin mu chu a thlâwk chhovin, Chhim lamah thla a zâr em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Muvanlai thlâwk chho leh, Sâng taka bu a chhep hi i thupêk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khâm kovahte a chêng a, Lung tohlâwt hmun him takah a riak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan ei tûr a bihthla a, A mit chuan hla tak a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A note pawhin thisen an dâwt a, Sa ruang awmnaah chuan a awm zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Joba hnênah a sawi zêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sawisêltu chuan Engkimtitheia chu a hnial ang maw? Pathian hnialtu chuan chhâng ang hmiang! tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, kei mi pawimawh tham lo tê hian Engtin nge ka chhân ang che? Ka kâ ka hup mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vawi khat ka sawi tawh a, ka chhâng tawh lo vang che; A ni, vawi hnih; ka chhunzawm tawh lo vang, a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Joba chu ṭhâwngaleivir aṭangin heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipa takin i puan veng la, Thu ka zâwt ang chia, mi hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thurêlte mi sûtsak dâwn em ni? Thiam i chan theih nân Thiam loh mi chantîr dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian bân ang i nei em ni? Amah angin khawpui ri aw i chhuah thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalna leh zahawmna han inbel la, Chawimawina leh ropuinain inthuam rawh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I thinrimna khat liam chu leih chhuak la, Mi chapo apiang chu en bîkin titlâwm teh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi chapo apiang chu en bîkin tihniam la, Mi suaksualte chu an dinhmunah rap bet rawh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaivutah phûm hlawm la, Hmun birûah an hmêlte phuar khâwm teh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, i kut ding lam ngeiin a chhan him thei che tih Kei ngei hian ka hria ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En teh, nangmah ang bawka Behemoth ka siam hi, Bâwng anga hnim ring mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh mah, a chakna chu a kâwngah a awm a, A thahrui chu a dul thuara awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sidar angin a mei a tikhauh va, A malpui thâte chu a phiar tlat mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ruhte chu ngên kawrawng ang a ni a, A fuke chu thîr tlâwn ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian siam u ber a ni a, A siamtu chuan a tân khandaih a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlângte chuan chaw an chhuahsak ṭhîn a, Chu chu ramsa zawng zawng tualchaina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lotus buk hnuaiahte a bawk a, Pumphîr hnuai leh dûmahte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotus buk chuan a zâr hlim a, Luia tuipuisuthlah chuan a hual vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngai rawh, tui a lo len buan buan pawhin a hlau ngai lo; A kâ thleng pawhin Jordan lian mah se, a zuam zêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A inrâlrin laiin miin an man thei em ni? A hnârah an thil thei ang em ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nghakuaiin leviathan i hnûk chhuak thei em ni? Hruihrualin a lei i phuar bet thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phairuang hruiin a hnârah i thil thei em ni? Nghakuaiin a khabe i thil tlang thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I hnênah dîlna tam tak a siam ang em ni? I hnênah thu nêmin a sawi ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumkhuaa rawngbâwltua i hman tûrin I hnênah thuthlung a siam ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sava ang lekin i khâl thei dâwn em ni? I hmeichhiate kaih atân i hlîng thei ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sangha mantuhoten indâwr nân an hmang ang em ni? Sumdâwng mite zîngah an sem darh ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vun khatin thîr hlîngte, A lûah nghafei te i riah thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A chungah kut han thlâk teh, In inbeih dân tûr chu ngaihtuah rawh, I ti leh tawh ngai lo vang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai rawh, mihring beiseina chu a thlâwn a ni; A hmuh mai pawhin a beidawng nghâl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah chawk tho tûrin tu mah an rorum ngam lo. Chuti a nih chuan tu nge ka hmaah ding thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu nge ka rulh leh tûra thil mi pe hmasa awm? Vân hnuaia thil engkim hi ka ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A fuke thûah ka ngawi reng lo vang a, A thahrui chakzia leh a taksa inphut tâwkziaahte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu nge a vun pâwnlâng chu hlîp thei ang? A khabe thuah hnih chhûngah tu nge lût thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin nge a hmêl kawngkapui chu hawng thei ang? A ha kual vêl chu ṭihbaiawm tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A vun châr chu a chhuan ber a ni a, Châr ang maia phui tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A insîk phui chiah avângin, A kârah boruak pawh a lût thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An inzawm ṭheuh va, an inphan tlat avângin Kaih ṭheh theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thaw chhuak chu a vâr sung sung a, A mitte chu khawfîngchat ang rû mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kâ aṭangin mei alh a chhuak a, Meisîte a ṭêk ur ur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnâr aṭangin meikhu a lo chhuak a, Sa so bêl nghawr leh phairuang mût ang vut vutin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thaw te chuan meihawl a tivâm a, A ka aṭangin mei alh a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nghâwngah chakna a awm a, A hmaah ṭihbaiawmna a tualchai reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ṭâng chhûng vun pawh khing rût, Taksa nên inbelhbawm tlat, khawih chêt rual loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thinlung chu lung anga sak a ni a, A ni, râwt sawmna lung hnuai zâwk ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amah a lo thawh chhuah meuh chuan Pasalṭhate pawhin an hlau va, An thlaphângin mahni pawh an inhre tawh ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miin khandaihin bei mah sela, a hneh lo vang; Fei emaw, thal emaw, feiṭam emaw pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thîrte chu buhpâwl ang lekah a ngai a, Ngên chu thing mawih angah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thalin a titlânchhe lo va, A lakah chuan virvawmte chu pâwl bul ang lek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Talhtumte chu pâwl bul ang lekah a ngai a, Feiṭam vung te chu a nuihsan mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A hnuai lampangte pawh lampei hriam tak ang a ni a; Diakahte chuan buhchîl khâwl ang maiin a bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tui thûk tak chu bêl angin a tiso buah buah a, Tuipui chu hlo bûr ang lekah a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kalna hnu chu a êng ruak a, Miin tuipui chu vâr buahin an hmu ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lei chungah hian amah ang rêng an awm lo ve, Hlauh nei hauh lova siam chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thil sâng apiang a en ṭhîn a, Inlulingte zînga a ber a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Engkim i ti thei tih ka hria e, I tum dâl rual eng mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Tu a ni nge, hriatna lova thurâwn thup botu hi?’ Chuvâng alâwm ka hriat thiam lohte, Ka tâna mak lutuk, ka hriat loh thilte ka sawi ni
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Ngaithla rawh le, ka han sawi ang e; Thu ka zâwt ang chia, mi hrilh ang che.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Benga hriatna mai zawngin ka hre tawh chia; Mahse, tûnah zawng ka hmu ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvâng tak chuan ka inten a, Vut leh vaivuta ṭhuin ka sim ta e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Joba hnênah hêng thute a sawi hnu hian Lalpa chuan Elifaza, Temani mi hnênah chuan, “I chungah leh i ṭhian pahnihte chungah khân ka thinurna a nasa a ni, ka chhiahhlawh Joba angin ka chungchâng thu dik takin in sawi si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, tûnah bawngpa pasarih leh berâmpa pasarih kengin ka chhiahhlawh Joba hnênah va kal ula, in tân hâlral inthawi va hlân rawh u; tin, ka chhiahhlawh Joba chuan a ṭawngṭaisak ang che u a, chu chu ka lo pawm ang a, in âtzia ang zêl chuan ka ti lo vang che u; ka chhiahhlawh Joba angin ka chungchâng thu dik takin in sawi si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Temani mi Elifaza leh Suhi mi Bildada leh Naamathi mi Zofara-te chu an va kal a, Lalpan thu a pêk ang zêl chuan an ti a; tin, Lalpa chuan Joba dîlna chu a pawm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan a ṭhiante pathum tâna a ṭawngṭai chuan, Lalpan Joba chan chu a tiṭha leh ta a; Lalpa chuan Joba chu a hmaa a neih lêt hnih a pe leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, a unau leh a farnu zawng zawngte leh, tûn hmaa a hmêlhriat zawng zawngte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, a inah chuan chawhlui te an kîl a; Lalpan a chunga thil ṭha lo a thlentîr zawng zawng thûah chuan an tuarpui a, an thlamuan a; mi tinin a hnênah chuan tangkaraw tlangte leh rangkachak zungbunte an pe ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chuan Joba hun hnuhnûng chu a tîr aia nasa takin mal a sâwm a; berâm sîngkhat leh sângli, sanghâwngsei sângruk, sebâwng tuak sângkhat leh sabengtungpui sângkhat a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fapa pasarih leh fanu pathum a nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a hmasa bera hmingah chuan Jemimai a sa a, pahnihna hmingah chuan Keziai, pathumna chu Keren-hapuki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ram zawng zawngah pawh Joba fanute anga hmeichhe hmêl ṭha an awm lo; an pa chuan anni chu an nuṭate zîngah ro chan tûr a pe ve hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, hetih hun hian Joba chu kum za leh kum sawmli a dam a, a fapate, a fapaa fapate, chhuan li thlengin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joba chu tar tak, khûp bihin a thi ta a.
  </para>
</usx>
